<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana ni kitabu kimwenga mwe vitabu vine ve Ndagano Im'pya vikulonga wikazi wa Yesu Kilisito. Vitabu ivo ivine nivo vikwitangwa Injili, nuko kugamba Mbuli Yedi, vawandikagwa ni Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana, aho Yesu eze ande kabanika. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana vadahika neiwandikwa ni Yohana uyo andaga mwigala Ulosi, hamwenga na kugamba kitabu iki hakikulonga ivo, mna Mbuli Yedi ino iwandikwa mwo mwaka wa milongo kenda kulawa aho Yesu eze elekwe. Miwandikile ya ikitabu iki, yaliganisa ne miwandikile ye baluwa ya nk'hongo na ya kaidi ne baluwa ya katatu awandike Yohana. Wawandishi wakale wamwenga wamwiika Yohana kugamba umwo Mbuli Yedi ino yandaga ikawandikwa, yehe Yohana andaga akekala mwo mzi wa Efeso, ivo yadahika kugamba kitabu iki chawandikwa mo mzi wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana atambalisa kugamba aunga kitabu iki kiwambize want'hu wahuwile kugamba Yesu niye Kilisito, naho niye Mwana Mnungu 20:31. Kwa kuhuwila ivi, chanda na ugima kwa zina dyakwe. Kitabu iki wawandikilwa want'hu wose, Wayahudi na want'hu hi Wayahudi. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana indilisa vituhu na ziya Mbuli Zedi zint'huhu. Yehe akaulisaga mwe vihungi adamanyaga Yesu na hawandikise mwe mbuli ye miliganyizo. Naho hawandike mbuli nk'hulu zilaile enga viya kubatizwa kwa Yesu na magezo yakwe uko kwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1:1-18, Yohana aikonga Mbuli Yedi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1:19-12:50, kawandika vihungi mfungate ivo Yesu adamanyaga.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 13:1-20:31, atambalisa mbuli nyingi zilaile mwo wikazi wa Yesu zimwigale mpaka kwe file yakwe na kuuyuka kwake.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 21, Yohana abindiliza Mbuli Yedi akatambalisa yalailaga zuwa dimwenga hadya Yesu awalailaga want'hu aho eze auyuke, niyo naho alonga kitalo chakwe mwo kuandika kitabu iki.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi ukukink'ha ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Aho nk'hongo handaga na Ulosi, naho uyo Ulosi andaga hamwenga na Mnungu, naho uyo Ulosi andaga Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kukongela nk'hongo Ulosi andaga hamwenga na Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Yehe niye atendaga vose vikalaila, andile hiyo yehe, hegu hakwalaile kint'hu chochose. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Yehe andaga chotoko cho ugima. Naho udya ugima wandaga ung'azi wa want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Ung'azi wang'ala mwe diziza, naho diziza hadikuudaha. <verse eid="JHN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Halailaga mnt'hu asiigilwe ni Mnungu, etangagwa Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Uyo ezaga vileke alonge uwona wo ung'azi, vileke want'hu wose wahuwile kwombokela kwa uwo. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Mna yehe andaga hiyo udya ung'azi mna ezaga vileke alonge uwona wo ung'azi. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Uno wandaga ung'azi we kindedi, ung'azi ukwiza kwe isi no kuwang'azila want'hu wose. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Andaga mwe Isi naho kwombokela yehe, Mnungu aumbaga isi, mna want'hu we isi waswesa kumkombaganya. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ezaga mwe isi yakwe mwenye mna want'hu we isi yakwe hawamhokele. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Mna wadya wamhokele na kuhuwila dizina dyakwe, awenk'haga udahi wa kunda wana Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Hawelekwe kimnt'humnt'hu kunda wanda Mnungu hegu kwa miungile ya mnt'hu, mna ni kwa kuunga kwakwe Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Yudya Ulosi niyo anda mnt'hu no kwikala kwetu, naswe nekiuona uwedi wakwe utendese, uwedi utendese enga wa Mwana haheina mtuhu enga yehe alaile kwa Tate, kamema uwedi ne ikindedi.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohana naakawagambila want'hu ikindedi che zimbuli za yudya Ulosi kwa kubongeela akagamba, “Uyo niye nalongaga zimbuli zakwe, ‘Eyuko akwiza kunyuma kwangu mna nakanilongoela kwaviya andaga uuko, umwo miye nandaga hinati kunda uuko.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kulawa mo uwingi wo wedi wakwe Mnungu, chose kihokela uvikilwa, kakink'ha suwe uvikilwa ubindile wingi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwaviya Mnungu nakenk'hiza miko kombokela kwa Musa, uwedi ne kindedi vegalagwa ni Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Hahali mnt'hu amuonaga Mnungu lupisi lwolwose, ila Mwana haheina mtuhu enga yehe eli Mnungu, andile hagihi na Mnungu Tate, niye akigambile mbuli za Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Uno nuwo uwona ulavigwe ni Yohana mwa Wayahudi wasigiilagwa ni walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Walawi kulawa Yelusalemu waite kwa Yohana wakamuuze, “Weye ni weye ani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohana halemele kuwahitula, awagambilaga haheina kifiso akawagamba, “Miye hiyo Kilisito.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Niyo wamuuza, “Haluse weye ni weye ani? Weye niweye Eliya.” Niyo awahitula, “Miye hiyo Eliya.” Niyo wamuuza vituhu, “Haluse ni yudya mlotezi?” Niyo awagamba, “Hiyo miye.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Naho niyo wamuuza, “Haluse weye ni weye ani? Vileke kikawagambile wadya wakitumile. Weye mwenye wakegamba ni weye ani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohana niyo awahitula kugamba, “Miye ni yudya alongaga Mlotezi Isaya ywa Mnungu mwe zimbuli zangu kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Izwi dya mnt'hu akubongeela kwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Ichululeni sila ya Zumbe.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Naho wadya wasigiilwe, watumwagwa ni Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Niyo wamuuza kugamba, “Nii wabatiza want'hu uneva weye hiyo Kilisito, naho hiyo Eliya hegu mlotezi yudya?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohana niyo awahitula, “Miye nabatiza kwa mazi mna mgati mwenyu eyaho akimale uyo nyuwe hemwimmanyize. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Yehe eza kunyuma kwangu mna miye hiwagilwe mbwitu kuhambula luzigi lwe vilatu vakwe.”<figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1:27">Mnt'hu anyinya sigi za vilatu</figure> <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Mbuli izi zalailaga Besania ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani, kudya Yohana andaga akabatiza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye ngoto ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Zuwa ditimile Yohana niyo amuona Yesu eza kwakwe, niyo agamba, “Kauleni, Mwanangoto ywa Mnungu ikuusa wavu we isi. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyu ni yudya nandaga halonga izimbuli zakwe, ‘Eyuko akwiza kunyuma kwangu mna ni mkulu kujink'ha miye kwaviya andaga uuko kukongela aho miye nandaga hinati nelekwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Naho miye hyammanyize, mna ni kwa kuunga Izilaeli wammanye, nivo valekile heza kubatiza want'hu kwa mazi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Naho Yohana nakalonga uwona kugamba, “Nehimuona Muye ywa Mnungu akaseela kulawa kwe mbingu enga suwa, no kukima mwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Naho miye hyammanyize, mna yudya aniletile miye nibatize want'hu kwa mazi niye anigambile, ‘Yudya ukuunga unamuwone Muye akaseela na kumkima hamwenga na kwikala mwakwe, uyo niye akubatiza kwa Muye ywa Mnungu.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Yohana na kagamba, “Miye mwenye hiona naho nalonga uwona kugamba uyu niye Mwana Mnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana mp'hina wa nk'hongo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Zuwa ditimile Yohana andaga kakimala naho hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe waidi. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Yohana naakamkaula Yesu umwo andile akagenda niyo agamba, “Kaula uyu nuyo Mwanangoto ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Wadya wanamp'hina wakwe waidi weze weve ivo alongile, niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu niyo ahituka no kuwaona wamtimila, niyo awagamba, “Mwaungai?” Niyo wamgamba, “Labi, nuko kugamba mhinizi wekalahi?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Niyo awahitula, “Soni mkaule.” Ivo wagendaga kuhaona hadya akwikala niyo wasindanya naye msi wose, naho iyo yandaga kisingi cha saa mlongo. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Anduleya nduguye dya Simoni Petulo andaga yumwenga ywa wadya waidi wamwivile Yohana niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Bosi, niyo Anduleya amzungula mkuluwe Simoni niyo amgamba, “Kimuona Masiha.” Uyo niye Kilisito Mlokozi. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Niyo amwigala kwa Yesu. Yesu niyo amkaula no kummgamba, “Weye niwe Simoni Mwana Yohana. Weye nowitangwe Kefa.” Kwa Kigiliki kuko kugamba, Petulo hegu “iwe”.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga Filipo hamwenga na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Zuwa ditimile Yesu aonaga vedi aite Galilaya, kudya ambwiilaga Filipo niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo andaga mkaya ywa Betisaida, mzi ukwo wakwikala Anduleya hamwenga na Petulo. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Filipo niyo ambwiila Natanaeli niyo amgamba, “Kimuona yudya Musa alongaga zimbuli zakwe mwe miko naho walotezi nao nawawandika zimbuli zakwe, Yesu Mwana Yusufu mnt'hu ywa Nazaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli niyo auza, “Kint'hu chedi chadahika ivivihi kulawa Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo naye niyo amgamba, “Soo ukaule,”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu eze amuone Natanaeli eza kwakwe amgambaga, “Kauleni Mwizilaeli ywe kindedi heena nyambi yoyose.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli niyo amuuza Yesu, “Weye kunimanya vivihi?” Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nehikuona hasi yo mtini umwo Filipo andile akei kukwitanga.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaeli niyo amhitula, “Mhinizi, weye ywi Mwana Mnungu, Seuta ywa Izilaeli.” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kwaviya nehikugamba hikuona hasi ho mtini, nivo vilekile ukahuwila? Nouone mbuli nk'hulu zikujink'ha izi.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Niyo amgamba, “nawagambilani ikindedi, namuwone ulanga ugubuke, watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wa Mnungu wakakwela na kuseela mwo Mwana Mnt'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahitula mazi kunda divai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Zuwa dya katatu niyo kwanda na ndoza uko Galilaya kwo mzi ukwitangwa Kana, nine dya Yesu naye andaga uuko. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe nawalalikwa mwe indoza iyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai ize isile nine dya Yesu niyo amgamba, “Divai yawe isila.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu niyo amgamba nine, “Mnala, kina mbwai miye na weye? Isa yangu ikei mpaka.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Nine niyo awagamba wandima, “Dyodyose akuunga awagambileni, damanyeni.” <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kwandaga na mabiga makulu mtandatu yakuikila mazi yo kuhaka viligane ne vihendo ve Kiyahudi, yadamanywe kwa maiwe, kila dimwenga dikudaha kumema mabiga ya mazi yakubula mtandatu mpaka mfungate. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Memezeni mazi mwa mabiga makulu.” Niyo wayamemeza mazi. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Niyo awagamba, “Tekeni amazi mmwigaile umkulu ywe ndoza,” Niyo watenda ivo. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Yudya umkulu ywe ndoza eze ayalume yadya mazi yahitukaga divai naho hamanyize uko ilaile mna wandima nawamanya, wadya wayatekile yadya mazi Yudya mkulu ywe ndoza amwitangaga yudya mlombi, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />niyo amgamba, “Want'hu wose waikaga lumwe divai yedi, wakajika ukunywa idya iyedi niho wegale idya iihile, weye kuika divai yedi mpaka ivi haluse.” <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Vilagiso ivi va nk'hongo, Yesu avidamanyaga uko Kana ya Galilaya vileke aulavanye uwedi wakwe utendese. Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhuwila.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aikukiza Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Akajika, Yesu na nine na wanduguze, hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe, waitaga Kapelinaumu niyo wekala uko mazuwa mageke.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19:45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Wila wa Wayahudi we Pasaka nounda uhagihi, Yesu niyo akwela kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu niyo aona want'hu wakutaga, ng'ombe, ngoto hamwenga na suwa manga. Naho no kunda na watuhu wakusakanya matundu.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2:14">Mnt'hu akusakanya matundu</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Alukaga kube no kudifundika fundo, no kukonga kuwagulusa kwa kuwatoa wose wandile mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, hamwenga na magoto ne zing'ombe na wadya wandile wakasakanya matundu, niyo ayetila matundu yawe hamwenga nakuzikindula zimeza zawe. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Niyo awagamba wadya nawakataga suwa manga, “Yafosezeni aya, msekuitenda nyumba ya Tate kunda hant'hu ha uchuuzi.” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakumbukila ivo iwandikwe, “Neningilwe ni finju ye nyumba yako.” <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Iki ni kilagiso chani kwa aya ukudamanya?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Imoleni Inyumba ino ya Mnungu, miye neni izenge mwa mazuwa matatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Wadya wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Nyumba ino ya Mnungu neizengigwa kwa myaka milongo mine na mtandatu, mna weye wagamba nouizenge kwa mazuwa matatu du?” <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Mna Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu andile akaisimuila nu umwili wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Aho eze auyuke wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakumbukila viya alongaga. Niyo wayahuwila mawandiko ya Mnungu hamwenga na ivo alongaga Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaimanya mioyo ya want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Umwo andile Yelusalemu mwo we Pasaka want'hu wengi wahuwilaga dizina dyakwe kwaviya wavionaga vilagiso vingi andaga akavidamanya. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Mna Yesu hakehuwilise kwakwe kwaviya nakawamanya wose. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Hakwaungigwe mnt'hu yeyose ywa kumlongela zimbuli zawe kwaviya yehe mwenye amanyaga zimbuli zi mwe mioyo yawe.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nikodemo amtalamkila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga ywa Mafalisayo zina dyakwe etangwagwa Nikodemo naho andaga kilongozi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Amwizilaga Yesu kilo kimwenga niyo amgamba, “Labi, kikumanya weye u mhinizi wizile kulawa kwa Mnungu, kwaviya hahali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kudamanya vihungi ukudamanya weye uneva Mnungu hehamwenga nayehe.” <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nakugambila ikindedi, mnt'hu hanelekwe kaidi hakudaha kuuona Useuta wa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo niyo amgamba, “Yadahika vivihi mnt'hu kwelekwa kaidi uneva kadalahala kale? Neidahike vivihi kwingila mwe inda ya nine niyo elekwa kaidi?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nakugambila ikindedi mnt'hu hanelekwe kwa mazi na kwa Muye Msuntila, hakudaha kwingila kwo Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Mwili weleka mwili mna Muye weleka Muye. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Usekwehelwa kwa mbuli iyo hugambile kwaviya waungwa kwelekwa kaidi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Mp'heho yavuma ivo ikuunga naho mvumilo wakwe wevika mna hukumanya uko ikulawa na uko ikuita naho nivo vili kwa mnt'hu elekwe ni Muye ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo niyo amhitula Yesu kugamba, “Mbuli izi zadahika ivivihi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Weye umhinizi wa Izilaeli mna zimbuli izi hukuzimanya? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nakugambila kindedia, ‘Diya kikudimanya chadilonga, na diya kidione chadilongela uwona, mna uwona wetu hamkuuzumila.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Uneva himigambilani mbuli za mwe isi mna hamhuwile, nomhuwile vivihi nnawagambilani mbuli za kwe mbingu? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Naho hahali mnt'hu akweile kwe mbingu, ila yehe ezile kulawa uko, uyo Mwana Mnt'hu. <verse eid="JHN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Enga iviya Musa ainulaga inyoka idya ye shaba mnanga mwo mti kudya kwe nyika, niivo vili kwa Mwana Mnt'hu, naye neenulwe kulanga, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />vileke kila yumwenga akumhuwila ande na ugima wa ulo na ulo mwa Yehe. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwaviya Mnungu awaungisaga want'hu wa mwe isi niyo amwigala Mwanawe heena miyawe vileke kila akumhuwila asekwaga mna ande no ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwaviya Mnungu hamletile Mwanawe mwe isi vileke awasengele want'hu wa mwe isi, mna keza vileke isi iyokolwe kwombokela yehe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Akumhuwila Mwana hakusengelwa, mna wose hewe kumhuwila wasengelwa kale, kwaviya hawadihuwile dizina dya Mwana Mnungu eli ikedu. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Naho usengelo wenye nuuno, ung'azi nowiza mwe isi, want'hu niyo waungisa ulwiza no kuulemela ung'azi, kwaviya udamanyi wawe nounda wiha. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kila akudamanya yaihile aulemela ung'azi naho hakwiza kwo ung'azi kwaviya hakuunga yadya akudamanya yaoneke. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Mna yeyose akudamanya yadya yakumwelela Mnungu eza kwo ung'azi vileke, yadya akudamanya yaoneke yadamanywa kwa kumwogoha Mnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ize yajike iyo, Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe waitaga mwe isi ya Uyahudi, niyo asinda uuko hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe, akabatiza want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yohana naye andaga akabatiza kint'hu kukwitangwa Ainoni, hagihi na Salimu kwaviya nokunda na mazi mengi, want'hu niyo waita kwakwe vileke wakabatizwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ayo yalailaga umwo Yohana andaga akei kuvugailwa mwe divugailo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Niyo wahigana. Wanamp'hina wa Yohana Mbatizi hamwenga na Myahudi yumwenga mwe mbuli yo kukuka. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Waitaga kwa Yohana niyo wamgamba, “Mhinizi, yudya mwandanye hamwenga kudya ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani, Yudya walongaga zimbuli zakwe, abatiza naho want'hu wose waita kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohana niyo awahitula, “Hakudaha mnt'hu kuhokela kint'hu uneva henk'higwe kulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Nyuwe wenye mwasimuila kugamba miye nehilonga, ‘miye hiyo Kilisito Mkombozi mna himlongoela yehe.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Mta mlombigwa niye Mlombi, mna mbwiyaye dyo mlombi akukin'ha no kumtegeleza, anda na kinyemi kikulu akeva diizwi dyo mlombi. Haluse! Ikinyemi changu kigenyela <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yehe aungwa kunda mkulu miye name ninde mdodo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ezile kulawa kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Yehe akwiza kulawa kwe mbingu ni mkulu ywa yose. Yeyose alaile mwe isi ni wa mwe isi, naho alonga zimbuli za mwe isi. Yehe akwiza kulawa kulanga, ekulanga kwa mbuli zose. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yadya ayaone nakuyeva nayo akuyasimuila, naho hahali akuzumila yadya akulonga. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yehe akuuzumila ulosi wakwe, kazumila kugamba, Mnungu ni mkindedi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yehe asigiilwe ni Mnungu alonga mbuli za Mnungu, kwaviya kenk'higwa Muye ywa Mnungu haheina kihimo. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tate amuungisa Mwanawe naho kamwink'ha vose mwe mikono yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Akumzumila Umwana naande no ugima wa ulo na ulo. Mnt'hu akumlemela Umwana hana ugima, naho naande mwe masulumizo ya Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga na Mvele we Kisamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo na weva kugamba Yesu andaga na wanamp'hina wengi hamwenga nakubatiza kujink'ha Yohana. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ikindedi Yesu yemwenye habatize want'hu, mna wanamp'hina wakwe nao nawakabatiza want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ivo Yesu eze eve ivo nawakalonga alawa Yudeya no kuuya naho Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Naho nevimuunga ombokele Samalia. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Niyo abula kwo mzi wa Samalia ukwitangwa Sikali, hagihi na udya mgunda wa Yakobo amwink'haga Mwanawe Yusufu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Hadya handa na sima dya Yakobo, mna kwaviya Yesu na andaga kasokela kwajili ye nt'hambo yakwe, niyo ekala hagihi ne disima. Naho ne inda nomsi. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Niyo heza mvele wa Kisamalia aungaga ateke mazi. Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nink'he mazi ninywe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Wanamp'hina wakwe nawaitaga kwo mzi wakagule nk'hande. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yudya mvele we Kisamalia niyo amgamba Yesu, “Inda vivihi weye Myahudi unilombeze miye mvele we Kisamalia amazi yo ukunywa?” Kwaviya Wayahudi na Wasamalia hawakuhangana. <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Wamanyize uwedi wa Mnungu, naho ni ani akukulombeza mazi yo ukunywa, hegu nawe waungile no kumlombeza, heye amazi, hegu nakakwink'ha mazi yo ugima.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, weye huna kint'hu cho kutekela mazi sima nadyo tali, haluse kulavahi amazi ayo yo ugima? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Haluse weye umkulu kujink'ha Tati yetu Yakobo akink'hile idisima idi, niyo yehe mwenye anywa amazi ye disima idi hamwenga na wanawe hamwenga ne mifugwa yakwe yose?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Akunywa amazi aya naaone nk'hilu naho, <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Mna mnt'hu akuunga anywe mazi aya yo ugima huunga nimwink'he, heeze aone nk'ilu naho, yadya mazi yo ugima huunga nimwink'he nayatende nch'oko za mazi yo ugima zikubwiluka mndani mwakwe, no kwink'hiza ugima wa ulo na ulo.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe nink'he miye mazi ayo nise kunda na nk'hilu naho, nisekwiza kuteka mazi ahaha naho.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Ita ukamwitange Mgosio wize naye aha!” <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yudya Mvele niyo amhitula, “Hina mgosi.” Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kulonga vedi, ‘Hina mgosi.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwaviya no kunda na wagosi washano, naho yudya unanaye ivi haluse hiyo ywako, aho kulonga kindedi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, naona weye umlotezi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Wakale wetu wavikaga mwo lugulu ulu mna nyuwe Wayahudi mwagamba hant'hu hawagilwe kumvika Mnungu ni Yelusalemu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mvele unihuwile, isa yeza, naho homumvike Tate mwo lugulu ulu, hegu kudya Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nyuwe mwamvika hemkummanya, suwe chavika yudya kimmanyize, kwaviya ukombola walawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Mna isa yeza naho ibula, wadya wakuvika kindedi nawamvikile Tate mwe kindedi mwe mioyo. Kwaviya Tate awazungula want'hu enga awo wakumvika. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Mnungu ni Muye woho nao wakumvika waungwa wamvike mwe mioyo yawe na kwa kindedi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Himanya neeze Masiha akwitangwa Kilisito, uyo aneza naakigambile kila kint'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Miye hulonga na weye nu uuyo!”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Aaho wanamp'hina wakwe wauyaga mna weheelagwa kwaviya Yesu andaga akalonga na mvele, mna hakwandaga na yeyose amuuzile kugamba “Waungai?” Hegu nii walonga naye? <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yudya mvele niyo aleka idibiga dyakwe, nokuita kwo mzi niyo awagamba want'hu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Soni mkaule mnt'hu anigambile mbuli zangu zose nidamanye, mafani uyu niye Kilisito.” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Niyo wahalawa kwo mzi na kuita kudya eli Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Umwo wandile woho wenye, wanamp'hina wakwe wamhembelezaga wakamgamba Mhinizi dya nk'hande. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Niyo awagamba, “Miye nnanayo nk'hande hemkuimanya.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wauzana woho wenye, “Haluse eyuko mnt'hu amwigaile nk'hande?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ikande yangu ni ino,” nidamanye yadya “akuunga yudya aniletile niibindilize indima yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nyuwe hamkulongaga isigala miezi mine vileke kibule mwo uvuni? Mna miye nawagambilani, inuleni meso yenyu mkaule migunda, iikwa lumwe kwa kuvuna. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Na yudya akuvuna ahokela maliho hamwenga na kukisanya matunda kwa mbuli yo ugima wa ulo na ulo, vileke yudya akuhanda na yudya akuvuna welelwe hamwenga. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwaviya aho elo ulosi watenda kindedi kugamba, yumwenga ahanda na mtuhu avuna. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Miye nehiwasigiila mkavune yadya hamyadamanyile ndima, watuhu nawadamanya ndima, nanywe mwengila mwe ndima.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Wasamalia wengi wo mzi udya, niyo wamhuwila kwa yadya alongile yudya mvele kugamba, “Kanigambila zimbuli zangu zose nidamanye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Niyo wadya wasamalia weze waite kwakwe, nawamhembelezesa vileke ekale kwawe. Yehe naye niyo ekala kwawe mazuwa maidi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Want'hu wengi vitendese, niyo wahuwila kwa mbuli ya udya ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Niyo wamgamba yudya mvele, “Haluseelo kihuwila naho hiyo kwa yadya ulongile du, mna kiiva suwe wenye naho chamanya ikindedi mnt'hu uyu nie mlokozi ywe Isi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Yeze yajike mazuwa maidi niyo ahalawa kudya no kuita Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Kwaviya Yesu ye mwenye nakalonga uwona kugamba, mlotezi hakutologwa kwawe, mwe Isi yakwe ye mwenye. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Viya eze abule Galilaya wadya want'hu wa Galilaya niyo wamhokela Kwaviya nawaziona mbuli zose Yesu adamanye kudya Yelusalemu mwe wila, Kwaviya wadya nao nawaita kwe wila. <verse eid="JHN 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Niyo abula vituhu mo Mzi wa Kana wandile Galilaya hadya ahitule amazi kunda divai. Nahanda na mkulu yumwenga wa selikali, Mwanawe na kanda mnyonge uko Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Uyo eze eve Yesu keza kulawa Uyahudi mpaka Galilaya niyo aita kwake, amlombezaga vileke asele, aite akamhonye Mwanawe ywa kibwanga, kwaviya na kanda hagihi na kubanika. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Haheina kuwona kilagiso na vihungi, hamkudaha kuhuwila.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yudya mkulu wa selekali niyo amgamba, “Zumbe hakeseleza seka Mwanangu anabanike.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Keitile, mwanao mgima!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Yudya mt'hu niyo ahuwila viya Yesu amlongile niyo atimila sila no kuita kwake. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Viya ndile akei mwe sila, wandima wakwe niyo wambwila na mbuli kugamba, “mwanawe kahona kale udya unyonge!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Eze awauze umuda mwanawe ahonile niyo wamgamba, “Unyonge umleka gulo msi wa saa mfungate.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Aaho ise niyo amanya umuda ni udya agambilwe na Yesu, “Mwanao, mgima kahona”. Niyo ahuwila yehe hamwenga na wose wandile mwe nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Icho ni kilagiso cha kaidi adamanye Yesu viya alaile Uyahudi mpaka Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu hagihi ne dikawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Niyo handa na zuwa dya kinyemi ya Wayahudi, Yesu nae niyo akwela kwita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Naho Yelusalemu, hagihi ne nk'hili ikwitangwa nk'hili ya ngoto handaga na kawa dya mazi dikwitangwa kwa kiibulania Betisaza, naho nedinda na wazila washano wazunguluke wa kombokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Naho wanyonge wengi, mant'hunt'hu, viwete na waholole, nawagona mwe ziya zisila zo kombokela. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Nawakagoja mazi yatibulwe, Kwaviya hamwenga aha mtumwa ywa Mnungu naakeza he dikawa na kuyatibula amazi. Mnyonge ywa nk'hongo kwingila mwa mazi umwo mmazi yakanda yatibulwa naakahona unyonge wowose andile nao. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Hadya nahanda na mnt'hu andile mnyonge kwa myaka milongo mitatu na mnane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu eze amuone yudya agonile, amanyaga kugamba andaga iivo kwa lupisi lutali, niyo amuuza, “Waunga unde mgima?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yudya mnyonge niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, miye hina mnt'hu akuunga anigele mwe dikawa dya mazi viya mazi yanatibulwa, viya miye heza, kuna mnt'hu mtuhu akunilongoela.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kimala ketwike kigonelo chako wiite.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ahadya yudya mnyonge niyo anda mgima, aketwika kigonelo chakwe na kugenda, naho zuwa diya nedinda dya kuhumula.<verse eid="JHN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wamgamba yudya ahonyigwe, “Dyelo ni zuwa dya kuhumula naho havikuungwa kwa weye kwinula ikigonelo.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Niyo awahitula, “Yudya atendile miye ninde mgima niye anigambile niketwike ikigonelo nigende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Niyo wamuuza, “Mnt'hu uyo akugambile uketwike wiite ni ani?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Mna yudya mnt'hu ahonyigwe andaga hammanyize yudya amhonyile, Kwaviya hadya na handa na want'hu wengi Yesu andaga kahalawa. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Niyo elo Yesu ambwiila Yudya mt'hu mwe nyumba yo kumvika Mnungu, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kaula kunda mgima, usekudamanya wavu naho, dinase dikakubwiila buli tuhu diihile kujink'ha idi.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo akeitila nokuwagambila vilongozi wa Wayahudi mnt'hu amhonyile ni Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwaviya Yesu nakahonya mnt'hu mwe dizuwa dya kuhumula Wayahudi niyo wakonga kumsunk'hasunk'ha. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Tate adamanya ndima mpaka ivi haluse, miye name nadamanya.” <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Mwe zimbuli izo, vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo watendesa kuzungula sila yo kumkoma, naho hiyo du kwa mbuli ya kudamanya ndima mwe zuwa dya kuhumula, mna hamwenga na kumwitanga Mnungu ise mwenye, naho nakuketenda kaligana na Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Mwana wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Ikindedi nawagambilani, Mwana hakudaha kudamanya ndima yoyose kwa udahi wakwe, mna idya amwuone Ise akadamanya Kwaviya yadya akudamanya Tate, naayo akuyadamanya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwaviya Tate amuungisa Mwana naho amlagisa yose akudamanya yehe mwenye, naho naamlagise mbuli nk'hulu ikujink'ha izi, nanywe nomwehelwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Enga viya Tate akuuyula want'hu wabanike nakuwatenda wande wagima, iviya iviya Mwana naye awatenda wagima wadya akuwaunga. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Naho Tate hakumsengela mnt'hu yeyose mna udahi wo usengelo kamwink'ha Mwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />vileke want'hu wamwive Mwana enga viya wakumwogoha Tate amwigale Umwana. Mnt'hu heekumwogoha Mwana, hakumwogoha Tate amwigale Umwana.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Namigambilani ikindedi, mnt'hu akuutegeleza ulosi wangu hamwenga nokumhuwila yudya aniletile ana ugima wa ulo na ulo, naho hakwingila mo usengelo mna na ande komboka kulawa kwo file kengila kwo ugima wa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Namigambilani ikindedi, isa yeza, naho ibula, wadya wabanike naweve izwi dya Mwana wa Mnungu naho wadya wakunga weve nawande wagima. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Enga viya Tate kunda ni chotoko cho ugima, kwe sila iiyo kamtenda Umwana naye kunda chotoko cha ugima. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Naye niyo amwink'ha Umwana udahi wa kusengela, Kwaviya yehe ni Mwana wa Mnt'hu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Msekwehelwa, Kwaviya isa yeza want'hu wose wandile mwe vikuta naweve izwi dyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />Naho nawauyuke, wadya watendile mbuli zedi kwa uuyulo wo ugima, na wadya watendile mbuli ziihile kwa uuyulo wo masulumizo.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Hikudaha kudamanya mbuli kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye, nalamula enga viya Mnungu anilagize, naho usengelo wangu miye wa kindedi, Kwaviya hikuzungula yadya huunga miye mwenye mna ya yudya aniletile.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukindedi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Mbuli zangu nnazilonga miye mwenye, nezinde hiyo kindedi. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Mna eyuko mnt'hu akunilongela mbuli zangu, naho miye himanya mbuli ziya akunilongela ni za kindedi. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nyuwe nomsigila want'hu kwa Yohana naye niyo alonga uwona we kindedi mwe zimbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Mna miye hikuhokela uwona uwo wakulonga want'hu, mna nalonga ivi vileke nyuwe myokolwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohana na kanda enga lumuli lukukwela kulangaza, naho nyuwe nomkeikila lumwe kuonela kinyemi ulumuli ulo kwa lupisi. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Mna uwona nnanawo miye ni mkulu kujink'ha udya wa Yohana Kwaviya zindima ziya anink'hile Tate nizidamanye zanilongela, naho zalagisa kugamba Tate niye anisigiile miye. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Tate aniletile kalonga kale uwona mwa miye, nyuwe hamnati mmuwone ifuta yakwe, naho hata kwiva izwi dyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Ulosi wakwe haumuli mwe mioyo yenyu, Kwaviya nyuwe hamkumhuwila yudya asigilwe ni Tate. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwakaulisa yadya yawandikwe kwaviya mmanya mndani mwakwe umwo mna ugima wa ulo na ulo. Mawandiko wenye wanilongela miye. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Hamkuunga kwiza kwangu vileke mnde na ugima.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Hiyo kugamba nazungula kutogolwa kulawa kwa want'hu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Mna hiwamanyani kugamba mwe mioyo yenyu hamna lukunde kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Miye hiza kwa udahi wa Tate, mna nyuwe hamkunihokela, mna mtuhu aneza kwe dizina dyakwe yehe mwenye uyo nomumhokele. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Nomdahe ivivihi kunihuwila nyuwe mkuhokela ukulu kulawa mwenyu, mna hamkuzungula ukulu kulawa kwa Mnungu? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Msekugamba neniwalongelezeni kwa Tate, eyuko akuwalongelezeni nyuwe, yehe ni Musa yudya nyuwe mkumkawiila. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Uneva mwamhuwile Musa, hegu nomnihuwila name Kwaviya yehe nakawandika zimbuli zangu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Mnaalo Kwaviya hamyahuwile yadya awandike Musa, nomhuwile vivihi aya miye hulonga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu enk'ha nk'hande want'hu magana milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Yesu niyo aita ng'ambu ye bahali ya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Fyo kulu dya want'hu dyamtimilaa kwaviya nawaviona vilagiso awadamanyile wanyonge. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu niyo akwela kwo lugulu no kwikala uko na wanamp'hina wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Wila wa wayahudi ye pasaka neinda ihagihi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu niyo enula meso yakwe, eze akaule niyo aona want'hu wengi wakumtimila, niyo amgamba Filipo, “Chakugulahi nk'hande ikuunga iweguse want'hu awa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Nakalonga viya vileke amgeze filipo, kwaviya yehe mwenye nakamanya kiya naakaunga adamanye. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo niyo amhitula, “Hata chandile na matundu yakubula dinali magana maidi, haya kudaha kugula mikate niyo kila yumwenga adye egute.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yumwenga ywa wanamp'hina wakwe akwitangwa Anduleya mvunawe dya Simoni Petulo, niyo agamba, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Kuna ndugu ywetu yumwenga ana mikate mishano na samaki mbili. Mna ivi nevikint'he mbwai mwa want'hu enga awa?” <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Wekazeni want'hu hasi”. Kwaviya na handa na mani mengi want'hu niyo wekala hasi, wagosi na wanda wabula elufu shano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu niyo aguha idya mikate nakumtogola Mnungu niyo awenk'ha wadya want'hu wekale hasi hamwenga na viya visamaki viidi kila yumwenga viya vikumkint'ha. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Want'hu wose weze wegute niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Kisanyeni wabesu wasigale kusekwaga kabesu kokose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />“Niyo waduganya awabesu wadya no kumemeza nt'hangulu mlongo na mbili.”<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Want'hu weze waone vilagiso viya adamanye Yesu, niyo wagamba, “Ikindedi uyuo ni yudya mlotezi chandile kikagoja.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu eze amanye nawakaunga kumtozeleza vileke ande Zumbe wawe, niyo ahalawa ikedu nokuita kwo lugulu.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agenda mnanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ize ibuze nekisingi wanamp'hina wakwe niyo waseleza kuita kwe diziwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Niyo wengila kwe ngalawa no kukonga kujink'hanya kuita Kapelinaumu, umuda uo kaziza nakakonga kwingila, Yesu nae na kanda akei kulaila. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Lupisi uo heho kulu nedikavumila, ibahali nayo neikonga kuhilukila. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Wana mp'hina wakwe weze wagambigwe wagendalugendo ukubula maili mnane, niyo wamuona Yesu agenda mnanga mwa mazina ehagihi ne ngalawa, wogohesa. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ni miye msekogoha.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Niyo wanda na kinyemi kikulu no kumhokela mwe ingalawa, lupisi ulo niyo wanda wabula kudya wandile wakaita.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wamzungula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Zuwa dya kaidi wadya want'hu wekale nt'hendelo idya ya kaidi nawaona kugamba handaga na ngalawa imwenga du, naho Yesu na kanda haitile na wanamp'hina wakwe, awanamp'hina wakwe nawahalawa woho wenye. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Mna zimashua nt'huhu kulawa Tibelia nazinda hagihi nakubula hadya hant'hu wadile imikate viya Yesu eze amtogola Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Wadya want'hu weze wabunk'hule Yesu na kanda hahali hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wengila mwe zia zingalawa na kwiita Kapelinaumu kumzungula.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye mkate wo ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Weze wambwile Yesu gundi ye diziwa niyo wamuuza, “Mhinizi, mpaka ini uku?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe hamkunizungula kwaviya vilagiso hamwenga na vilagiso viya hudamanya, mna mwanizungula kwaviya no mdya imikate niyo mweguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Msekuidamanyila ndima nk'hande ikubanika mna damanyileni ndima nk'hande heikusila, nk'hande yo ugima wa ulo na ulo ink'hande iyo nomwink'higwe ni Mwana wa Mnt'hu naho Tate Mnungu ye mwenye kalagisa kugamba, kamsagula na kumzumila.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Niyo wamuuza, “Haluse kitende vivihi vileke kidahe kudamanya viya Mnungu akuunga kidamanye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kiya mkuungwa ni Mnungu mdamanye ni kugamba, mumhuwile yudya asigilwe.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Niyo wamgamba, “Noudamanye kilagiso chani kikione vileke kikuhuwile? Noudamanye kint'hu chani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Wakale wetu, nawadya nk'hande ikwitangwa mana mwe nyika enga yadya yawandikwe yakulonga, ‘Nakawenk'ha mikate kulawa kwa Mnungu niyo wadya.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nawagambileni ikindedi, hiyo Musa awenk'heni imikate kulawa kwo ulanga Tate niye awenk'heni mkate we kindedi kulawa kwo ulanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwaviya mkate wa Mnungu ni yudya aseele kulawa kwa Mnungu na yehe niye akwink'hiza ugima want'hu wa mwe Isi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe, kink'he iyo nk'hande mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Miye niye nk'hande ikwink'hiza ugima, mnt'hu akwiza kwangu haaone sala naho, naho yudya akunihuwila heeze aone nk'hilu. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Mna himigambilani, mwaniyona mna mkei hamkuunga kunihuwila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Wadya wose Tate anink'hile naweze kwangu naho yudya akwiza kwangu henimduule kuse. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwaviya hizile kulawa kwa Mnungu vileke nidamanye yadya huunga miye, mna hiza vileke nidamanye yadya akuunga yudya akisigiile. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Viya akuunga yudya akisigiile ni ivi, ‘Nisekumwaza hata yumwenga mwe wadya anink'hile mna vileke niwauyule wose mwe dizuwa diya dyo uheelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwaviya mbuli akuunga Tate ni ino, wose wamuwone umwana no kumhuwila wande na ugima wa ulo na ulo name neniwauyule mwe dizuwa dyo uheelo.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Wayahudi niyo wakonga kun'gung'uzika Kwaviya naakagamba, “Miye ni mkate nizile kulawa kulanga kwa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Niyo wauza, “Uyo hiyo Yesu mwana ywa Yusufu? Naho ise na nine hikugamba kiwamanya? Haluse ni mbwai akigamba kaseela kulawa kwa Mnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mse kungunguzika, <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Hahali mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kwangu uneva Tate anitumile miye hamletile kwangu, name nenimuuyule mwe zuwa dyo uheelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Enga walotezi wa Mnungu viya wawandike, ‘Wose nawahinizwa na Mnungu.’ Yehe akumtegeleza Tate hamwenga na kuhina kulawa kwakwe, neeze kwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Uko nuko kugamba hakuna mnt'hu amuone Tate, mna ni yudya alaile kwa Mnungu, nie amuone kale Tate. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Namigambilani ikindedi, akunihuwila ananao ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Miye niye nk'hande yo ugima, <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Tati zenyu na wadya mana kwe dijangwa mna niyo wabanika. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Mna aha hana nk'hande ilaile kwa Mnungu, naho mnt'hu yeyose anadya haabanike, <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Miye niyo ink'hande ilaile kwa Mnungu, Mnt'hu yeyose anadya iyo ink'hande neekale ulo na ulo. Naho nk'hande yenye niino, umwili wangu huunga niulave vileke want'hu wose mwe isi wande na ugima.” <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Aho wayahudi niyo wakonga kuhigana wenye kwa wenye wakauzana, “Mnt'hu uyu adaha vivihi kukink'ha suwe umwili wakwe kiudye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi, hamna udile umwili wakwe Mwana wa Adamu hamwenga na kuinywa isakame yakwe, hamkudaha kunda na ugima mndani mwenyu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Wadya wakuudya umwili wangu hamwenga na kuinywa isakame yangu wananao ugima wa ulo na ulo. Naho miye neniwauyule mwe dizuwa dyo uheelo. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwaviya umwili wangu niyo nk'hande ye kindedi na isakame yangu nicho cho ukunywa che kindedi. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Wakuudya umwili wangu nakuinywa isakame yangu wekala mndani mwangu name nekala mndani mwawe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Tate emgima kanisigila miye, miye name ni mgima kwa Tate, Ivi yudya akuunga anidye naende mgima umwangu. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ino niyo ink'hande ikuseela kulawa kwa Mnungu hiyo enga viya Tati zenyu wadile idya nk'hande niyo wafa, mna akuunga adye ino nk'hande naande mgima ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Mbuli izi nakazilonga mwe nyumba yo kuvikila uko Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo yo ugima houkusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Wanamp'hina wakwe wengi weze weve mabilikizi yakwe niyo wagamba, “Mabilikizi yakwe ni madala, akuunga ayatongele ni ani?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Mwe umoyo wakwe Yesu niyo abunk'hula kugamba, wanamp'hina wakwe wangunguzika mwe yadya alongile, niyo awagamba, “Haluse ulosi uno umilumizani mwe mioyo? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Haluse neinde vivihi mkamuona Mwana wa Adamu akwela akaita kudya alawaga? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Kikugela ugima ni Muye ywa Mnungu, mnt'hu hana udahi wowose. Mbuli nimigambileni nuwo ugima, na Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Mna mwa nyuwe kuna watuhu wakei kuhuwila” Yesu na kanda kamanya kukongela aho nk'hongo yudya hehuwile hamwenga na yudya akuunga amsenge. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Niyo agendeela ukulonga, “Ivo nivo vilekile hamigambilani, hahali mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kwangu uneva Tate haungile.” <verse eid="JHN 6:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Mbuli iyo niiyo ilekile wengi mwa wanamp'hina wakwe wauye kunyuma waleke kumtimila. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu niyo awagamba wadya mlongo na waidi, “Togoleni nyuwe nanywe mwaunga mhalawe?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petulo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe kiite kwaani? Weye una mbuli zo ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Suwe kikuhuwila naho kibunk'hula kugamba weye niwe msuntilwa ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Togoleni, miye himisaguleni nyuwe mlongo na waidi mna yumwenga ywenyu ni Mwavu?” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Naakalonga Yuda mwana ywa Simoni Isikaliyote. Yehe na kanda yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wa Yesu mna niye andile nakaunga amsezenge.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Akajika Yesu andaga akagenda uko Galilaya, andaga hakuunga akomboka mwo Uyahudi kwaviya Wayahudi nawanda wakamzungula vileke wamkome. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Naho dizuwa dya kinyemi dya Wayahudi dye viheha nedinda dihagihi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Nduguze niyo wamgamba, “Halawe aha uite Uyahudi, vileke wanamp'hina wako wakaule zindima zako ukudamanya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Kwaviya hahali mnt'hu akuunga adamanye zindima kwa kinyele, mna ye mwenye aunga amanyike. Kwaviya weye wadamanya izimbuli izi, leka want'hu wose wa mwe Isi wakumanye. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Kwaviya hata wanduguze na wanda hawakumhuwila.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Lupisi lwangu ukei mpaka, kila lupisi niwedi kwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Want'hu wa mwe isi hawakudaha kumiihieni, mna waniihia miye, Kwaviya miye nalonga uwona mwa yehe kugamba udamanyi wakwe wiha. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nyuwe iteni kwe wila mna miye nikei Kwaviya umuda wangu ukei mpaka.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu nakalonga ivi niyo asigala ukudya Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi ye vikumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Nduguze weze waite kwe wila Yesu nae niyo aita, Mna nakaita kwa kifiso vileke asekuoneka. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Wakulu wa wayahudi nawakamzungula kudya kwe wila wakauzana, “E kuhi uyu?” <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Want'hu wengi na wanda mwe vibungi wakasimuila zi mbuli zakwe. Wamwenga nawakagamba, “uyuno ni mnt'hu ywedi.” Awatuhu nao niyo wagamba, “Hiyo mnt'hu ywedi Kwaviya awazaganya want'hu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Mna hahali mnt'hu alongile mwe kieti Kwaviya nawaka wogoha wayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Mgati mwe wila Yesu niyo akwela no kwingila mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu no kukonga kuhiniza. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Wayahudi niyo wehelwa wakagamba, “Uyu kalavai umanyi wa aya yose nae hasomile heusomile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Yano huhiniza hiyo mahinyo yangu, mna lawa kwa Tate aniletile miye. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mnt'hu akuunga adamanye zimbuli ziya Mnungu akuunga, naamanye uneva aya huhiniza yalawa kwa Mnungu hegu ni yangu miye mwenye. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Mnt'hu akukelongela ye mwenye aunga akeink'he uwedi utendese ye mwenye. Mna yudya akuunga amwinule yudya amletile uyu niwakindedi naho hauhali wiihi mndani mwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Musa hawenk'heni miko? Mna hahali hata yumwenga mwa nyuwe azitozile. Nii mwaunga mnikome miye?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Idifyo diya dya want'hu niyo dyamhitula, “Una mp'hepo! Uyo akuunga akukome weye ni ani?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nehidamanya kihungi nyuwe nyose niyo mwehelwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa nakawasigila muwavinile wana wenyu wa kigosi Mna neinda hiyo Musa aungile na wanda Tati zenyu walongole naho mwavinila wana mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Uneva mwana wa kigosi kavinilwa mwe dizuwa dya kuhumula, vileke miko ya Musa isekubanangwa, nii mwanifila maya Kwaviya nitendile mnt'hu ande mgima mwe zuwa dyo kuhumula? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Msekulava usengelo kwa kukaula kwa kuse mna laveni usengelo kwa kukaula ikindedi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye Kilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Want'hu watuhu we Yelusalemu niyo wagamba, “Ivi yuno hiye yudya mnt'hu wakumzungulanga vileke wamkome? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Kauleni alonga mwe kiyeti mna hawakulonga dyodyose. Togoleni, vilongozi wamanya ikindedi kugamba yuno niye Kilisito? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Mna Kilisito aneza hahali mnt'hu akuunga amanye uko alaile. Mna suwe chose kimanya kudya akulawa yuno mnt'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Umwo Yesu andaga akahiniza mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Icho nk'hindedi kugamba mnimanya, naho kudya nilaile mkumanya. Hizile kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye. Yudya anigale miye, yehe ni mkindedi, mna hamummanyize. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Mna miye himmanya kwaviya hiza kulawa kwakwe naho yehe niye aniletile.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Aho naho wagezaga kumgwila, mna hakwandaga na yeyose yumwenga amtozaga kwaviya lupisi lwakwe lwandaga lukei. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Niyo want'hu wengi mwe difyo diya wamhuwilaga wakagamba, “Aho Kilisito akezakwiza, naadamanye vilagiso vingi enga ivi adamanye yuno?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watowani wasigiilwa wakamgwile Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo niyo weva viya want'hu wakungungula mwe mbuli izi za Yesu, niyo woho hamwenga na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wasigiila wamizi we Nyumba ink'hulu ya Mnungu vileke waite wakamgwile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu niyo alonga, “Usigala lupisi mdodo wa kunda na nyuwe, nikakuheza neniite zangu kwa yudya aniletile. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Namunzungule mna hamnione, kwaviya hamkudaha kwiita kudya huunga ninde.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Niyo wayahudi wauzana, “Ni kuhi uko aite, uko hekimuwone? Haluse aunga aite kwe mizi ye Wagiliki kudya want'hu wetu wakwikala nakuwahiniza Wagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Nivo naakagaaze umwo akagamba, nomnizungule mna hamnione naho homdahe kwiita kudya huunga niite?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vizuto va mazi ya ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Mwe zuwa dya uheelo, zuwa diya kulu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi, Yesu niyo akimaala alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Mnt'hu yudya ane nk'hilu eze kwangu anywe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Enga viya iwandikwe, ‘Yudya akunihuwila, vizuto va mazi yo ugima navilawe kulawa mndani mwakwe.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu nakalonga ivi kwa mbuli ye Muye ywa Mnungu, yudya wadya wakumhuwila nawamhokele. Mwe lupisi kiya Muye na kanda akei kwiza kwaviya Yesu na kanda akei kutogoleswa ni Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchakukana kwa want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Want'hu wamwenga naweva viya alongile niyo walonga, “Mnt'hu uyu, kindedi ni Mlotezi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Want'hu watuhu niyo wagamba, “Uyu ni Kilisito!” Mna watuhu niyo wagamba, “Vyadahika Kilisito kulawa Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Mawandiko wakigambila, Kilisito naalaile mwo lukolo lwa Zumbe Daudi naho neelekigwe Betelehemu mzi ekalaga Daudi.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Niyo handa na kupangana kwa want'hu kwa mbuli yakwe Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Watuhu nawakaunga kumgwila, mna hahali amtozile.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuswesa kuhuwila kwa Vilongozi wa Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Wadya wamizi wa Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu wasigilwe weze wauye, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo niyo wawauza, “Nii hammwigale?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Wadya wamizi wa Nyumba ya Mnungu niyo wahitula, “Hahalailaga hata mnt'hu yumwenga akulonga enga mnt'hu uyu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Mafalisayo niyo wawauza, “Hata nyuwe mwazaganywa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Nyuwe mummanya yeyeso mwe Vilongozi hegu mwe Mafalisayo akumhuwila yehe? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Want'hu wano hawamanyize miko ya Musa, waligitwa ni Mnungu!” <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Mwe wadya mafalisayo, Nikodemo andagaaho, yudya aitaga kwa Yesu, niyo awagambila weyawe, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Mwe miko ya kwetu hakikudaha kumsengela mnt'hu uneva kikei kumtegeleza na kumanya idyo adamanye.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Niyo wamhitula, “Weye nawe kulaila Galilaya? Kaula mo Mawandiko Akukile naho nauone hahali mlotezi ezile kulawa Galilaya.” <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Niyo kila yumwenga aita kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mvele agwiligwe kwo uhabwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu niyo aita kwo Mnima lwe Mizeituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Mtootondo, niyo auya naho kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. Want'hu wose wamzungulukaga niyo yehe ekala hasi no kukonga kuwahiniza. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Wahinizi we miko hamwenga na Mafalisayo niyo wamwigaila mvele agwiligwe akadamanya uhambwasi, niyo wamkimalisa hameso ya want'hu wose. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Niyo wamgamba Yesu, “Mhinizi, mvele uyu kagwiligwa akadamanya uhabwasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mwe miko yetu Musa kakigamba, mvele enga uyu aungigwa atoigwe maiwe mpaka abanike. Weye wagaaze?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Nawalonga ivi kumtegela Yesu vileke wamlongeleze. Mna yehe niyo afunamaga hasi niya akonga kuwandika hasi na kadole kakwe.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Weze wande wakagendeela kumuuza maswali, Yesu akimaalaga nakuwagamba, “Mnt'hu yeyose mwenyu heena wavu ande ywa nk'hongo kumduila iwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Niyo afunama naho nakuwandika hasi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Weze weve ivi, wose niyo wahalawa, yumwe yumwe wakakongela wadala vilongozi. Yesu niyo asigala ekedu na yudya mvele endile akei kakimala. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu niyo akimaala, amgamba yudya mvele, “Wekuhi? Hasigale hata yumwenga akukulongeleza?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Yudya mvele niyo amhitula, “Zumbe hawahali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Yesu niyo agamba, “Vedi. Hata miye hikukusengela keitile, mna unasekudamanya wavu naho.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ung'azi we isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu niyo alonga vituhu na Mafalisayo, “Miye niye ung'azi we isi.” Niyo agendeela, “Yudya akunitimila na ande na ung'azi wa ugima naho haagendele mwo lwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Mafalisayo niyo wamgamba, “Weye walava uwona wako mwenye, na izo ukukelongela uwona hiyo za kindedi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hata nnakelongela uwona mbuli idya hukelongela ni kindedi, Kwaviya himanya kudya hulawa na kudya huita. Nyuwe hammanyize kudya hulawa hamwenga na kudya huita. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nyuwe mwasengela kimnt'humnt'hu, miye himsengele mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Mna uneva nnadamanya ivo, usengelo wangu nounde wakindedi. Kwaviya miye hikedu, Tate yudya anigale e hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Iwandikwa mwe miko yenyu kugamba, ‘Uneva want'hu waidi wanalava uwona ukuligana, icho wakulonga, ni kindedi.’ ” <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />“Nalonga uwona wa miye mwenye, Tate yangu nae anigale anilongela uwona.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Niyo wamuuza, “Iso eihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hamnimanyize miye naho hamummanyize Tate. Mwanimanyize miye hata Tate hegu nomummanya.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu nakalonga yose aya viya andile akahiniza mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. Mwe chumba kikuikigwa ikindolo cha malavo Naho hahali hata yumwenga amgwiile Kwaviya umuda wakwe no unda ukei mpaka.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamkudaha kuita kudya miye huita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu niyo alonga nao vituhu, “Nenihalawe nanywe nomnizungule, mna nomfe mwo wavu wenyu. Hamkudaha kuita kudya miye huita.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wagamba, “Agamba hakikudaha kuita kudya akuunga aite, haluse kigambe aunga akekome yehe mwenye?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe ni wa aha he isi, mna miye hiza kulawa kulanga kwa Mnungu. Nyuwe mwalawa mwe isi ino mna miye hiyo wa ino isi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Ivo nivo vilekile hamigambilani nomfe kwo wavu uwo mnanawo, naho nomfe mwo wavu wenyu uneva hamkuhuwila kugamba, ‘Miye ni Yehe.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Niyo wamuuza, “Weye ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Idiya nawagambilani kukongela aho nk'hongo. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nnanazo mbuli nyingi za kulonga mwa want'hu wose wamwe isi, na za kuwasengela nyuwe, yudya anigale miye yehe ni Mkindedi. Naho nawagambila want'hu diya nivile kulawa kwakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Hawabunk'hule kugamba Yesu nakawagambila mbuli ya Ise. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnamwinula Mwana wa Mnt'hu nommanye, ‘Miye niye Yehe.’ Naho nommanye hikudamanya mbuli yoyose kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye, mna nalonga dia Tate anisigiile nnonge. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Naho yudya anigale miye e hamwenga na miye, hakunasa nikedu, Kwaviya nadamanya mbuli ziku mbwedeza.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Want'hu wengi wamhuwilaga Yesu aho weze wamwive ivo andaga akayalonga ayo.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana ywa Mnt'hu naawaikeni nyuwe vilekelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu niyo awagamba wadya Wayahudi wakumhuwila, “Mnayazumila amahinizo yangu, nomnde wanamp'hina wangu kindedi, <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />naivo nommanye ikindedi, naho icho ikindedi nekiwaikeni ulekelwa.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Niyo wamhitula, “Suwe kiwelekwa wa Ibulahimu, naho hakinati kinde watumwa wa mnt'hu yeyose. Nii wakigamba, ‘Nomnde walekelwa?’ ”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi, kila mnt'hu akudamanya wavu, mtumwa wo wavu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Mtumwa hiyo mwana ywa mwe kaya mazuwa yose, mna mwana mwelekwa, yehe ni ywa umudya mndani mazuwa yose. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Uneva Mwana anawatenda mnde walekelwa, nomnde vilekelwa we kindedi. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Hiwamanyani nyuwe ni cheleko cha Ibulahimu, mna mwaunga mnikome, kwaviya hamkuyaunga mahinizo yangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Miye nalonga diya Tate anilagise, mna nyuwe mwadamanya diya mgambilwe ni tati yenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Niyo wamhitula, “Tati yetu ni Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Uneva mwandile wana Ibulahimu, hegu mwadamanye zimbuli enga ziya adamanye. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Yose nidamanye, nikumigambilani kindedi nivile kulawa kwa Mnungu mna mwaunga mnikome. Ibulahimu hadamanye mbuli enga izi! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwadamanya mbuli enga ziya tati yenyu adamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Niyo wamhitula, suwe hachelekwe mwo uhabwasi. “Kina Tate yetu yumwenga du niye Mnungu. Suwe naswe kiwana wakwe wa kindedi.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnungu andile tati yenyu kindedi, hegu nomniunga kwaviya nalawa kwakwe naho hiza. Hizile miye mwenye mna yehe niye aniletile. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Nii hamkukombaganya diya hulonga? Kwaviya hamkuunga kwiva ulosi wangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nyuwe wana wa tati yenyu Mwavu, naho mwaunngisa kuyatimila yadya tati yenyu akuyaunga. Kukongela nk'hongo na kanda mkomi, naho akei ande mwe kindedi, Kwaviya hamna ikindedi mndani mwakwe, kwaviya aho akalonga uudant'hi, alagisa viya eli, kwaviya yehe mwenye ni mdant'hi na tate wo udant'hi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Name Kwaviya nalonga ikindedi nivo vikuleka hamkunihuwila. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ni yuhi mwa nyuwe akudaha kulagisa kugamba miye hidamanya wavu? Miye nnalonga ikindedi nii nyuwe hamkunihuwila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Mnt'hu ywa Mnungu eva yadya ya Mnungu, Mna nyuwe hamkwiva Kwaviya hiyo wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Wayahudi niyo wamhomola Yesu wakagamba, “Haluse suwe hakikulonga ikindedi kugamba weye hwi Msamalia naho una mp'hepo?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Miye hina mp'hepo. Namtunya Tate, mna nyuwe hamkunitunya. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Mna miye hikuzungula ukulu, eyuko akuzungula ukulu uwo, niyehe akuunga asengele. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ikindedi namigambilani, mnt'hu aneva yadya hulonga haabanike chu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Mna Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Haluse kibunk'hula kugamba una mp'hepo iihile. Ibulahimu kabanika hamwenga na walotezi wose mna weye wagamba, Mnt'hu anatoza mahinizo yako haabanike chu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Weye umkulu kujink'ha tati yetu Ibulahimu abanike. Na walotezi wose wa Mnungu wabanika, weye waketenda niwe ani? <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “nakeink'ha ukulu miye mwenye, nt'hunyo yangu hiyo kint'hu, akunitunya ni Tate, yudya nyuwe mkugamba Mnungu ywenyu. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Naho nyuwe hamummanyize mna miye himmanya, nnagamba himmanyize neninde mlulimi enga nyuwe, mna miye himmanya naho hitoza ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tati yenyu Ibulahimu na kanda na kinyemi kikulu, Kwaviya akuunga adione dizuwa dyo kwiza kwangu naho niyo adiona na kwelelwa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Weye ukei kubuza myaka milongo mishano mna kumuwona Ibulahimu!”<verse eid="JHN 8:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ikindedi nawagambileni,” “Ibulahimu umwo andaga akei kwelekwa, ‘Miye ni aho’.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Niyo walogota maiwe vileke wamtoe, Yesu niyo akefisa nakufosa mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu no kuhalawa.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu elekwe mant'hunt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Umwo Yesu andile akomboka, amuwonaga mnt'hu andaga mant'hunt'hu kukongela kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamuuza, “Mhinizi, mnt'hu uyu na wadya wamweleke ni yuhi adamanye wiihi vilekile akalekwa mant'hunt'hu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Yuno hadamanye wiihi naho hata wadya wamweleke. Mna ivi vilaila vileke ndima za Mnungu zioneke. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Naho yaungigwa kizidamanye zindima zakwe yehe akisigiile kukei nomsi, kilo cheza naho mnt'hu haadahe kudamanya ndima. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Lupisi nili mwe isi, miye ni ung'azi we isi”<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Eze ajink'he kulonga ivo, niyo atwa mate hasi, adamanya nt'hope kwa yadya mate, amhaka int'hope idya mwa meso, yudya andile nt'hunt'hu. <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />Niyo amgamba, “Ita ukahake mwe dibilika dya Siloamu.” Zina Siloamu ni ulosi wa Kiibulania, nuko kugamba, “Atumigwe.” Basi niyo aita nao kuhaka mazi, niyo auya meso yakwe yaona.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Want'hu we haguhi naye na wadya wamuwone kale viya endile hakuona, naho viya endile mlombezi, niyo wauza, “Haluse yuno hi yudya endile akekala na kulombeza?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Hiyo yehe mna kakaeiga du.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Mna yehe mwenye niyo agamba, “Miye ni yehe.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />ivo wamuuzaga wakamgamba, “Meso yako yafinyulwa vivihi?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Yehe niyo awahitula, “Mnt'hu yudya akwitangwa Yesu nakadamanya nt'hope, niyo anihaka mwe meso, anigamba, ‘Ita Siloamu ukahake.’ Niyo naita nahaka mazi vatenda naona.” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Niyo wamgambila, “E kuhi uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Yehe nae niyo awahitula, “Miye himanyize.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wauza mbuli ya kuhonyigwa mnt'hu tunt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Niyo wamwigala kwe Mafalisayo yudya endile hakuona. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Naho na inda mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula viya Yesu adamanye ziya nt'hope na kumgela yudya mnt'hu akanda aona. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Mafalisayo niyo wamuuza vituhu viya vendile niyo meso yakwe yanda yaona. Yehe niyo awagamba, “Nakanigela nt'hope mwe meso niyo nahaka mazi valekile ivi haluse naona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo watuhu niyo wagamba, “Mnt'hu uyo halaile kwa Mnungu, kwaviya hakuitoza miko ya zuwa dya kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Mna watuhu niyo wauza, “Yadahika vivihi mnt'hu mta wiihi kudamanya vilagiso va vihungi?” Niyo woho wenye wanda wapangana.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Mafalisayo niyo wamuza vituhu uyo mnt'hu endile matunt'hu, “Togola, we mwenye wamgaze mnt'hu uyo akufumbule ameso yako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Niyo awagamba, “Mnt'hu uyo ni mlotezi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wenda hawakuhuwila kugamba mnt'hu uyo andaga hakuona mpaka weze wawetange wadya wamweleke. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Niyo wawauza kugamba, “Yuno niye mwana wenyu mkugamba nakelekwa hakuona? Inda vivihi inde aona?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Welesi wakwe niyo wawahitula, “Suwe kimanya yuno niye mwana wetu, naho kimanya nakelekwa matunt'hu. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Mna inda vivihi akanda aona, suwe hakimanyize, naho hakimanyize uyo atendile akaona. Muuzeni yehe mwenye, Kwaviya yehe ni mnt'hu mkulu naawagambileni!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Welesi wakwe nawalonga ivo Kwaviya nawakawogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi Kwaviya vilongozi awo nawagambilana kugamba, mnt'hu yeyose analonga kugamba Yesu ni Kilisito naaguluswe mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Nivo vilekile welesi wakwe wakalonga, “Ni mnt'hu mkulu muuzeni yehe mwenye.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Niyo wamwitanga kaidi yudya andile nt'hunt'hu, niyo wamgamba, “Mwink'he uwedi utendese Mnungu, ulonge kindedi! Suwe kimanya mnt'hu uyo ni mta wavu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo awahitula, “Uneva yehe ni mta wavu miye himanyize, himanya mbuli imwenga, nehinda nt'hunt'hu mna ivi haluse naona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Basi niyo wamuuza, “Nakakudamanyila mbwai? Nakakugubula meso vivihi yani?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Niyo awahitula, “Himigambilani, mna hamkunihuwila. Kwa mbwai mwaunga kwiva naho vituhu? Nyuwe nanywe mwaunga mwinde wanamp'hina wakwe?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Niyo wamhomola kugamba, “Weye u mwanamp'hina wakwe! Suwe ki wanamp'hina wa Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Suwe kimanya Mnungu nakalonga na Musa, mna yudya hakimmanyize uko alaile!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo awahitula, “Mbuli iyo ni ya kwehelesa! Nyuwe hammanyize uko alaile mna katenda meso yangu yande yaona! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Kimanya kugamba Mnungu hakuwategelaza wata wavu, awategeleza want'hu wakumwogoha Mnungu na kudamanya yadya akuunga. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kukongela nk'hongo ye isi hakinati kive kugamba kuna mnt'hu agubule meso ya mnt'hu elekwe matunt'hu. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Uneva mnt'hu uyo halaile kwa Mnungu, heedahile kudamanya mbuli yoyose.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Niyo wamhitula, “Weye nokwelekwa na kukuila mo wavu! Ivi wadaha kukihiniza suwe?” Niyo wamgulusa kuse.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utunt'hu wa kimuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu niyo eva kugamba wamgulusa mwe nyumba, umnt'hu yudya amhonyile, eze amuone, niyo amuuza, “Weye wamhuwila Mwana wa Mnt'hu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, ni yuhi uyo vileke nimhuwile?”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Kumuwona, naho yudya akulonga na weye ivi haluse ni yehe!”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amvika nokumgamba, “Zumbe, nahuwila.” <verse eid="JHN 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Miye hiza umu mwe isi kwa mbuli ya usengelo wadya hewekuona waone, na wadya wakuanyanya kugamba waona wande mant'hunt'hu.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo watuhu wandile hamwenga na yehe niyo weva viya alongile, niyo wamgamba, “Haluse wakigamba suwe naswe kimant'hunt'hu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mwandile mant'hunt'hu heguamwandile no uwavu mna mwagamba ‘Chaona’ ivo elo uwavu wenyu wekala.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi, yehe hekwingila mwe nk'hili yo mngo we zingoto mna ombokela kunk'handa uyo mbavi naho mhoki. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Akwingila mwo lwivi yehe niye mdimi ywe zingoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mwamizi amkomoela mdimi kwaviya ngoto zammanya dizwi dyakwe, naho kwaviya kazimanya amazina yawe azitanga no kuzigala kuse. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ngoto zakwe zose zina fosa kuse yehe alongola naho ngoto zamtimila kwaviya zidimanya diizwi dyakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Mtakwiza hazikumtimila kwaviya hazimmanyize diizwi dyakwe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu nakawagambila mliganyizo uwo, mna woho hawakombaganye imbuli iyo awagambile.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mdimi Ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu niyo awagambila vituhu, “Ikindedi nawagambilani, miye nie ulwivi lwa magoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Wose wanilongoele ni wabavi naho wahoki, naho magoto hayaweve. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Miye nulo ulwivi. Mnt'hu akuunga engile kwa kombokela kwangu naahone, neengile na kufosa naho naapate nk'hande. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mbavi aneza eza vileke abawe, achinje, hamwenga na kubananga, miye hiza vileke wande na ugima naho wande nao telele.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Miye nie mdimi ywedi, mdimi ywedi adaha kulava ugima wakwe kwajili yamagoto yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mnt'hu akulihwa hiyo mdimi, kwaviya yehe zingoto hiyo zakwe, anayaona magwema yeza azileka zingoto no kunyilika. Naho digwema dyazigwila na hamwenga nakuzimwaganisa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Yehe anyilika kwaviya ni mnt'hu ywa kulihwa naho mbuli ye zingoto hiyo kint'hu kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Miye nuyo mdimi ywedi, wadya wakwangu hiwamanya, wadya awangu wanimanya miye. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Enga viya Tate akunimanya, miye name nammanya. Miye naulava ugima wangu kwa mbuli ye zingoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Naho nnanazo ngoto nt'huhu zandile hiyo zo umngo uno, zoho nazo naungigwa nizilete, naho nezive mluzi wangu. Naho nakunde na fyo dimwenga na mdimi yumwenga.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Ivo elo nivo vilekile Tate akaniungisa, kwaviya naulava ugima wangu akajika nauguha naho vituhu. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Hahali mnt'hu akuulava ugima wangu mna ni miye mwenye. Name nnanawo udahi wakuulava, nnanawo udahi wa kuuguha naho vituhu. Ivo nivo anisiigile Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Nia kwanda na kupangana mwe wayahudi kwa mbuli ye yadya Yesu alongile. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Awengi wawe niyo wagamba, “Uyu ana mp'hepo iihile naho mhezi! Mwamtegeleza wai?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Ulosi uwo hiyo wa mta mp'hepo iihile, haluse mp'hepo iihile yadaha kumtenda mnt'hu aone?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Kudya Yelusalemu no kunda na zuwa dya kinyemi ya kukumbukila ukuki we Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu naho neinda ni mwe nyota. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu andaga akagenda mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu mwe ukumbi ya Sulemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Wayahudi niyo wamzunguluka wakamgamba, “Haluse noukigele nk'huswank'huswa mpaka ini? Uneva weye niwe Kilisito Mkombozi hake kigambile ikindedi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nehiwagambila mna nyuwe hamkunihuwila, ndima izi hudamanya kwa zina dya Tate niizo zikunilavila uwona. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Mna nyuwe hamkuunga hamkunihuwila Kwaviya hiyo ngoto zangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Zigoto zangu zawiva mluzi wangu, miye hizimanya zoho nazo zanitimila. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Miye name nazink'ha ugima wa ulo na ulo, nazo hezibanike, naho hahali mnt'hu akuunga azipokole kulawa mwe mikono yangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tate anink'hile awant'hu awa ni mkulu kujink'ha wose. Naho hahali mnt'hu akudaha kuwaguha kulawa mwe mikono ya Tate. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Miye na Tate ni kitu kimwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Wayahudi niyo walogota maiwe vituhu vileke wamtoe. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Zindima zedi nyingi zikulawa kwa Tate hiwalagisani, mwe indima ihi mwe izo ikutenda mnitoe maiwe?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Mwe zindima izedi hakikukutoa maiwe, mna kwe mbuli ya kumlonga vihile Mnungu, naho Kwaviya weye umnt'hu mna waketenda Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Togoleni haiwandikwe mwe miko yenyu kugamba, ‘miye hilonga nyuwe milungu?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Kimanya kugamba diya diwandikwe mwe Mawandiko Akukile nikindedi mazuwa yose, naho Mnungu kawetanga wadya want'hu milungu, want'hu wadya wenk'higwe ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Tate kanisagula miye naho kanisigila mwe isi, togoleni ivi mwadaha kugamba namhomole Kwaviya hilonga miye nuuyo Mwana ywa Mnungu? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Uneva hikudamanya zindima za Tate zia akuunga nizidamanye, msekunihuwila. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Mna nnazidamanya uneva hamkunihuwila miye huwileni zindima, vileke mmanye Tate ekala mndani mwangu name nekala mndani mwa Tate.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Niyo wazungula naho kumgwila, mna niyo achupuluka mwe mikono yawe.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Niyo akeitila gundi yo mto Yolodani mpaka hadya hant'hu Yohana andile akabatiza want'hu, niyo ekala uko. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Want'hu wengi niyo wambasa wakagamba, “Yohana hadamanye kilagiso chochose mna yose ayalongile Yohana mwe milosi na yanda ya kindedi.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Niyo want'hu wengi hadya wamhuwila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">File Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Kuna mnt'hu akwitangwa Lazalo endile akekala Besania, mnt'hu uyu andaga mnyonge. Besania na winda mzi akwikala Maliamu na lumbudye Masa. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maliamu uyu ni yudya amhakile mavuta Zumbe, yo mhemp'he mwo mtwi wakwe nakumhangusa ne zifili zakwe. Mkuluwe akwitangwa Lazalo nie andaga mnyonye. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Wadya walumbuze niyo wamwigaila ulosi Yesu, kugamba, Zumbe “mbuyayo Lazalo alumwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu eze eve mbuli ino niyo alonga, “Unyonge uno homtende Lazalo abanike, unyonge uno ulaila vileke Mnungu enk'higwe ukulu ino naitende Mwana wa Adamu ahokele ukukile.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu nakawaunga Masa na lumbudye hamwenga na Lazalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Yesu eze eve Lazalo mnyonge niyo enda ukudya endile kwa mazuwa matuhu maidi. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Kiteni zatu Yudeya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhitula, “Mhinizi, mazuwa mageke yomboke Wayahudi kudya nawakaunga kukutowa maiwe naho waunga kuuya uko?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Msi hikugaa una masaa mlongo na maidi, naho mnt'hu anagenda mwe ungazi wa nomsi hakukehamiza Kwaviya kuna nulu. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Mna anagenda nekilo naagwe kwaviya kuna ziza.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu nakalonga ivi naho niyo ongezela, “Mbuyetu Lazalo kabanika mna nenite hamwinule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhitula, “Zumbe uneva kagona mnyonge naahone.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Mna Yesu na kanda na ivo vo kugamba kabanika, mna woho nawakagamba na kanda kabanika kagona. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu niyo awagambila pwilili, “Lazalo kabanika.” <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Mna miye nnakinyemi Kwaviya na kinda hakihamwenga na yehe vikuunga nyuwe mhuwile, haluseelo kiteni kwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Tomasi yudya akwitangwa pasa niyo awagambila wanamp'hina weyawe, “Kiteni chose hamwenga na mhinizi vileke kibanike hamwenga.”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye ufufuo na ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu eze abule niyo abwiila lazalo kabanika mwe mazuwa matatu yomboke. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Besania na handa hagihi na Yelusalemu, enga maili zikubula nt'hatu, <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />naho wayahudi wengi na weza kuwasangalaza Masa hamwenga na Maliamu kwa mbuli ya file ya ndugu yawe.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Masa eze eve Yesu keza niyo afosa kuse vileke wadugane, mna Maliamu niyo asigala kundani kwe nyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Masa niyo amgambila Yesu, “Zumbe, wandile aha mkulu ywangu hegu habanike! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Mna himanya Mnungu adaha akakwika dyodyose diya ukunga ulombeze hata ivi haluse.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu niyo amgammba, “nduguyo naauyuke.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Masa niyo amhitula, “Himanya naauyuke mwe zuwa dya uheelo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Miye nuwo uyulo no ugima. Wose wakunihuwila, wakeza kubanika nawande wagima. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Naho wose wakwikala na kunihuwila haweze wabanike. Weye wahuwila mbuli ino?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Niyo amhitula, “Heiye Zumbe!” “Nahuwila kugamba weye ni we Kilisito, Mwana Mnungu naakaungwa kwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Masa eze ajike kulonga ayo auyaga niyo amwitanga Maliamu lumbudye kwa kinyele akamgamba, “Mhinizi e aha naho akuuza weye.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia eze eve niyo atenda nguvu aita kuse vileke akadugane naye. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu na kanda akei mpaka mwe kaya mna na kanda hant'hu abwiilane na Masa. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Elo Wayahudi wandile hamwenga na Maliamu wakamhembeleza niyo wamtimila weze wamuwone atenda nguvu kwinuka na kwiita kuse. Nawakagamba aita kwe kikuta kwiila uko.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Maliamu niyo abula hadya andaga Yesu, eze ambwiile niyo agwa mwe viga akamgamba, “Zumbe wandile aha ndugu yangu hegu habanike!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu niyo amkaula ivo andaga akaila, niyo akaula wadya Wayahudi wandile hamwenga na Maliamu ivo nawakaila. Yesu niyo engilwa ni mbazi mwo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Mummoselahi msanga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Niyo wamhitula, “Zumbe so ukaule.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu niyo anyukumila. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Wayahudi niyo wagamba, “Kauleni ivo naakamuungisa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Hikugamba awatendaga mant'hunt'hu waone, nii hamtendile Lazalo asekubanika?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo auyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu umwo andile akei na kinyulu mwo moyo abulaga he kikuta, iyo yandaga mp'hanga igubikwe na iwe mnanga mwo lwingiilo lwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu niyo awagamba. “Diuseni diiwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Masa lumbudye dya mto kubanika niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, anunk'ha kwaviya ana mazuwa mane kukongela aho eze abanike”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Hikugambile una huwila nauone ukulu wa Mnungu?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Niyo wadihausa diiwe, Yesu niyo akaula kulanga niyo agamba, “Tate nakutogola kwaviya wanitegeleza. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Mna nalonga ivi kwa mbuli ya awa want'hu vileke wahuwile kugamba weye niwe uniletile.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Eze ajink'he kulonga ivi niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Lazalo, so kuse!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Lazalo niyo afosa kuse, mikono yakwe hamwenga na viga vikakigwa sanda, kihanga chakwe nacho kigubikwa kitambala. Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mhauseni isanda, naho mlekeni aite.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzungu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Elo Wayahudi wengi wezile kwa Maliamu niyo waiona mbuli idya Yesu adamanyaga, wamhuwilaga. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Mna watuhu waitaga kwa Mafalisayo niyo wawagambaila ivo Yesu adamanye. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo hamwenga na wakulu wose niyo wadugana ne kitala chose wakagamba, “Kitende vivihi haluse? Kauleni vihungi ivo akudamanya!” <figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11:47">Mlava nt'hambiko we Kiyahudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Uneva kinamleka agendeele na ivi akudamanya, want'hu nawamhuwile naho Walumi naweze niyo wabananga Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu hamwenga na kukikaila.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Yumwenga ywawe andaga aketangwa Kayafa andaga mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko mwo mwaka udya niyo awagamba, “Nii mwanda wahezi! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Haluse hammanyize nevinde vedi mnt'hu yumwenga abanike kwa mbuli ya want'hu wengi kujink'ha kuleka isi ngima ikabanika?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ikindedi halongile ivi kwa mbuli yakwe yehe mwenye, mna kwa kunda mlava nt'hambiko mkulu mwaka udya, naakalotela ukubanika kwa Yesu naafe kwa ajili ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Naho hiyo kwa woho du Mna kuwaduganya hamwenga mo umwili umwenga want'hu wose wa Mnungu wasaguke.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kutimila zuwa diya, Wayahudi niyo wazungula sila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yesu hagendaga akaoneka mwa Wayahudi. Ahalawaga niyo aita hant'hu hagihi ne dijangwa kwo mzi ukwitangwa Efulaimu ukwo ekalaga hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Wila wa Wayahudi wa Pasaka wandaga hagihi. Want'hu wakwelaga kulawa kwe zink'honde zawe kwiita Yelusalemu, vileke wakekukize kwaviya na wakeika lumwe kwa Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Niyo wamzungula Yesu. Umwo weze wadugane mwe nyumba ya kumvika Mnungu, niyo wakonga kuuzana woho kwa woho, “Wafanyanya mbwai? Kigambe haeze mwe zuwa dya kinyemi!” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo nawasigila kugamba uneva kuna mnt'hu yeyose avile uko Yesu eli alonge vileke wamgwile.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agelwa mafuta ko mzi wa Besania</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Mazuwa sita mpaka mwe zuwa dya Pasaka Yesu niyo aita Besania kaya kwa Lazalo yudya Yesu amuuyula kulawa kwe file. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Niyo wamwambikila nk'hande ya nomsi, Masa niyo amdamanyila ndima. Lazalo na kanda yumwenga ya wadya wekale hamwenga na Yesu <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Niyo Maliamu aguha nusu lita ya mavuta ya mhemp'he, amhake mavuta ayo Yesu mwe viga, naho niyo amhangusa ne zifili zakwe. Niyo idya inyumba yose yanda na mhemp'he wedi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yumwenga mwe wanamp'hina wa Yesu akwitangwa Yuda Isikaliyote, Yudya akuunga eze amsezenge niyo agamba, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Nii mavuta yano yedi yasekutagwa kwa matundu mengi naho niyo wenk'higwa want'hu haweena kint'hu?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Nakalonga ivi naho hiyo Kwaviya naakawaungisa want'hu haweena kint'hu, mna Kwaviya na kanda mbavi naho yehe niye naakatoza umkoba wandile na matundu.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Mna Yesu niyo alonga, “Mlekeni! Adamanya ivi kwa mbuli ye maziko yangu. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Mazuwa yose mnanao want'hu haweena kint'hu mna homnde na miye mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo azungulwa akomigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Wayahudi wengi niyo weva kugamba Yesu emwo mzi wa Besania niyo waita kudya andile naho hiyo Kwaviya Yesu na kanda kudya, mna uleke wakamkaule Lazalo, yudya Yesu amuuyule mwe file. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Naho niyo wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wazungula sila vileke wamkome Lazalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />Kwaviya mbuli idya neikatenda Wayahudi wengi kuwalemela woho nakumhuwila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa kinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Zuwa dya kaidi want'hu wengi wezile mwe wila ye Pasaka niyo weva kugamba Yesu keza Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Niyo waguha matambi ye mitende nakugenda kumsingiila, kwa izwi nawakagamba, “Zumbe atogolwe, Mnungu amwink'he uvikilwa yudya akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe, Mnungu amwink'he uvikilwa Zumbe we Izilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu niyo akwela mp'hunda enga viya iwandikwe, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Mzi wa Sayuni usekogoha Zumbe ywako eza akweile mwana mp'hunda.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Wanamp'hina wakwe hawabunk'hule imbuli idya, mna Yesu eze atogolwe niyo wabunk'hula viya iwandikwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Want'hu wandile na Yesu hadya amwitange Lazalo kulawa mwe kikuta na kunda mgima niyo wasimwila viya vilaile. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Ivo niivo valekaga want'hu wengi wakamwizila kwaviya na weva ivilagiso ve vihungi viya adamanye. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Mafalisayo niyo wagambilana, “Kauleni ivo kikudunguga naho ulumwengu mgima wamtimila Yehe!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagiliki wamwenga waunga wamwone Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Mwe wadya want'hu wezile Yelusalemu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi watuhu nawanda Wagiliki. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Niyo waita kwa Filipo, mnt'hu wa Betisaida mwe isi ya Galilaya wamgamba, “Zumbe, chaunga kimwone Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo niyo agenda kumgambila Anduleya, wose waidi niyo waita wakumgambila Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Isa ibula Mwana wa Mnt'hu akuunga atogolwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, mp'huluzi ye uhemba neisigale iivo imwenga hainahandigwe mwe ulongo niyo yafa. Uneva inabanika neyeleke mp'huluzi nyingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Wadya wakuuunga wikazi wawe nawazaganye na wadya hewekuunga wikazi wawe mwe ino isi nawawiike kwa mbuli ya wikazi wa ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Yudya akuunga kunidamanyila ndima miye naanitongele Kwaviya hadya huunga ninde mtumwa ywangu naande naye aho. Naho yudya akuunga anidamanyile ndima Tate naamwink'he ukulu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Haluse moyo wangu una kinyulu, haluse nigeeze? ‘Tate niyokole mwo lupisi ulu lukunizila.’ Mna iyo nivo vilekile miye heza vileke nombokele mwo lupisi ulo lwa masulumizo. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tate, uketogole dizina dyako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Niyo Izwi dyevika kulawa kwo ulanga, “Hiketogola kale naho neniketogole naho.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Fyo dya want'hu wandile hadya niyo weva diya izwi, watuhu niyo walonga, “Neinda mtint'hilo naho watuhu niyo wagamba na kanda mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu alongile.”<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Mna Yesu niyo awagambila, “Izwi idi hadivike kwa mbuli yangu miye mna kwa mbuli ya nyuwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Naho uno nuwo umuda wa ino isi kusengelwa, naho Mwavu mkulu we isi ino, naadulwe. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Umwo nnenulwa kulawa hasi, neniwaguhe want'hu wose kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Mwo kulonga ivi, naakalongela ifile yakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Fyo dya want'hu niyo wamhitula, “Miko yakigambila Kilisito neekale mazuwa yose, nii weye naho wakigamba Mwana wa Mnt'hu neenulwe kulanga? Uyu Mwana ywo Mnt'hu ni yuhi?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Ung'azi nounde na nyuwe kwa lupisi luguhi, gendeleeni kwaviya mna ung'azi, ziza dinase kuwahumani, kwaviya yudya akugenda mwe diziza hamanyize kudya akwiita. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Kwaviya mnanao ung'azi uhuwileni, vileke mnde want'hu wo ung'azi. Yesu eze ajink'he kulonga ivi niyo ahalawa na kugenda kukefisa.”<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu waswesa kuhuwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Hamwenga nakugamba Yesu nakadamanya vilagiso mwa meso yawe mna woho hawahuwile. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ivo niyo viya valongagwa ni Mlotezi Isaya vakelaviliza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Zumbe, ni ani akuhuwila mbuli kikulonga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Ni kwa ani udahi wa Mnungu ukunga ukelavilize?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Naho nawenda hawakuunga kuhuwila, Kwaviya Mlotezi Isaya nakalonga naho,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Mnungu kawagela u nt'hunt'hu ameso yawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">hamwenga na kuitenda mioyo yawe inde midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wanase wakanihitukila vileke niwahonye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">Naho mioyo yawe inase ikakombaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">wanase wakanihitukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">vileke miye niwahonye,”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya nakalonga ivi Kwaviya nakauona ukulu wakwe Yesu na kuzilonga zimbuli zakwe.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Naho mwe wakulu we Wayahudi nomnda na watuhu wengi wandile wakamhuwila Yesu, mna kwa ajili ye Mafalisayo nawanda hawakulonga imbuli ino mwe kiyeti wanase wakaguluswa kulawa mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Kwaviya nawakaungisa kwink'higwa ukulu na want'hu kujink'ha ikwink'higwa ukulu na Mnungu.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Yesu walava usengelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu niyo alonga kwa kubongeela, “Yudya akunihuwila miye hiyo anihuwila miye du, mna amhuwila na yudya aniletile. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yudya anione miye kamuwona hata yudya aniletile. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Hiza mwe Isi ninde ung'azi vileke yudya akunihuwila miye asekwingila mwo lwiza. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yudya akwiva ulosi wangu niyo hakuutimila hikumsengela, miye hizile kwa mbuli ya kuwasengela want'hu wa isi mna kuwahonya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Wadya wakunilemela miye hamwenga na ulosi wangu eyuko yumwenga akuunga awasengele. Ulosi udya nilongile nuwo ukuunga uwasengele mwe dizuwa dya uheelo. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Iki ni kindedi kwaviya hilongile kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye mna Tate yudya aniletile miye nie anisigiile yo kulonga. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Naho himanya miko yakwe zenk'hiza ugima wa ulo na ulo, yadya nilongile ni yadya Tate akisigiile miye nilonge.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu asunt'ha wanamp'hina wakwe iviga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Neinda disigala zuwa dimwenga mpaka zuwa dya Pasaka. Yesu nakamanya isa yakwe ibula ya kuhalawa mwe isi na kuita kwa Ise. Naho naakawaunga wadya wandile wakwe mwe isi. Mazuwa yose naakawaunga.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe nawanda mwe nk'hande ya nekilo. Mwavu nakamwingila kale Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikaliyote mo umoyo uleke amsezenge Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu nakamanya kugamba Tate kaika kila kint'hu mwo udahi wakwe. Nakamanya keza kulawa kwa Mnungu naho naauye uko kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Niyo akimaala hadya andile niyo aita kunk'handa no kuhambula isuke yakwe yandile mnanga mwe kitambala kituhu, niyo akekaka mwe kigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Yesu niyo agela mazi mwe dikalai, no kukonga kuwasunt'ha wanamp'hina wakwe iviga hamwenga na kuwahangusa na kitambala chandile mwe kigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Niyo abula kwa Simoni Petulo, mna Simoni niyo amuuza, “Zumbe, weye unisunt'he iviga vangu?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Haukudaha kukombaganya ivi haluse imbuli ino hudamanya, mna nouwize ubunk'hule mwa mazuwa yakwiza.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petulo niyo amgambila Yesu, “Weye hukudaha kunisunt'ha miye iviga vangu.” Yesu niyo amhitula, “Hinakusunt'hile iviga vako, hukudaha kunda mwanamp'hina ywangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petulo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe usekunisunt'ha iviga vangu du mna hata mikono hamwenga no mtwi wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Ahakile kale hakuungwa kuhaka umwili mna ahaka iviga du. Kwaviya kasunt'hika kale umwili wakwe. Nyuwe msunt'hika mna hiyo wose.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu nakamanya yudya akuunga amsezenge nivo vilekile akalonga, “Hiyo wose msunt'hike.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Yeu eze ajinke kuwasunt'ha iviga vawe niyo avala idya isuke yakwe na kuuya hadya hant'hu hakwe andile nakekala no na kuwauza wanamp'hina wakwe, “Togoleni, mwakombaganya ayo nimidamanyileni?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />“Mwanitanga miye Mhinizi hamwenga na Zumbe, naho mwadamanya vedi ivo mkudamanya, kwaviya ivo niivo nili. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Miye ni Zumbe na Mhinizi ywenyu naho hiwasunt'ha iviga vyenyu nyuwe nanywe mwaungwa msunt'hane iviga. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Hidamanya mliganyizo vileke nyuwe nanywe mdamanye enga viya miye niwa damanyileni. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Namigambilani ikindedi, mtumwa hiyo mkulu kujink'ha zumbe ywakwe, naho mwigala ulosi hiyo mkulu kujink'ha yudya amwigale. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Naho ivo mmanyize kindedi neinde vedi mdamanye enga ivo mmanyize.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Hikulonga kwa nyuwe nyose, hiwamanya wadya niwasagule, mna vileke yadya yawandikwe yakint'he, kugamba, ‘Yumwenga kikudya hamwenga kanihituka no kunitendela vihile!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Namigambilani, mbuli ino ikei kulaila vileke inalaila mhuwile kugamba, ‘Miye ni Yehe.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Nawagambilani kindedi, yudya akumhokela yudya ni mwigale anihokela miye, na akunihokela miye amhokela yudya anigale miye.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye kusezengwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22:21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu eze ajink'he kulonga ivi, niyo abanika mnyunk'humilo mo umoyo wakwe. Niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi yumwenga ywenyu naanisezenge.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakaulana woho wenye, wakauzana uyo akulongigwa ni ani? <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Mwanamp'hina yumwenga, yudya naakaungiswa na Yesu nakeekala hagihi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simoni Petulo niyo amhungila mkono akamgamba, “Muuze Zumbe uyo akulongigwa ni ani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Niyo yudya mwanamp'hina asogelesa hagihi na Yesu na kumuuza, “Zumbe, mnt'hu uyo ni ani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Uyo huunga nimchank'hizile mkate mwe kaziga, na kumwink'ha ni yehe.” Niyo aguha kabesu kwo mkate na kukachank'hiza mwe kaziga na kumwink'ha Yuda mwana Simoni Isikaliyote. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda eze ajink'he kuudya udya mkate Mwavu niyo amwingila. Yesu naye niyo amgamba, “Tenda nguvu idyo ukudamanya.” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Naho hahali hata mnt'hu yumwenga akombaganye, nii Yesu nakalonga viya kwa Yuda. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwaviya Yuda andaga akatoza mkoba wa matundu, wanamp'hina watuhu nawakafanyanya kugamba Yesu nakamsigila aite kokuguha vint'hu nevikaungigwa kwa mbuli ye zuwa dya kinyemi ye Pasaka hegu kuwenk'ha wakiwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda niyo ahokela umkate nakufosa kuse, naho neinda nekilo.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mp'hya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda eze afose Yesu niyo agamba, “Haluse elo Mwana ywa Mnungu katogolwa na Mnungu Katogolwa mndani mwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Uneva ukulu wa Mnungu ugubulwa mndani mwo Mwana, Ivo Mnungu na alagise ukulu wo Mwana mndani mwakwe mwenye Naho naatende ivo nguzu. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Wana wangu, heninde na nyuwe lupisi lutali mna nomnizungule, nawagambila viya niwagambile wakulu wa Wayahudi, ‘Hamkudaha kuita kudya huunga nite miye.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Naho ivi haluse nawenk'hani sigilizi mp'hya, ‘Muungane enga viya miye niwaungile, kila yumwenga amuunge miyawe.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mnaungana, kila yumwenga naamanye kugamba muwanamp'hina wangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga viya Petulo akuunga amlemele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petulo niyo amuuza Yesu, “Zumbe waitahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesu amhitula, “Uko huita hukudaha kunitimila haluse, mna nowize unitimile.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petulo niyo amuuza, “Zumbe, nii hikudaha kukutimila ivi haluse, miye nadaha kubanika kwa mbuli yako weye.”<verse eid="JHN 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Kindedi weye wadaha kubanika kwa mbuli yangu miye? Nakugambila ikindedi, iviya zogolo dikei kuila, diyelo naulonge nk'hanana nt'hatu kugamba hunimanyize!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu sila ya kuita kwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Msekogoha, mwamhuwila Mnungu, nihuwileni miye name. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mwe nyumba ya Tate, mna wikazi mwingi, naho miye nagenda kuwaikilani lumwe hant'hu ho kwikala, vandile hiyo ivo hegu nehimigambilani. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Nnaita nnajika kumiikilani lumwe, nenize niwaguheni vileke mnde hadya huunga ninde miye. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Naho muimanya isila idya ikuita kudya huunga niite.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi niyo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe hakimanyize kudya ukuita haluse nekimanye vivihi isila ikuunga ikibuze uko?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Ni miye sila ne ikindedi, no ugima, Hahali akuunga aite kwa Tate hanombokele kwangu.” <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Kwaviya mnimanya miye nomumanye Tate naye, naho kukongela ivi haluse mummanya Tate naho mmuona.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, suwe icho kikuunga ukilagise Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Filipo kwa lupisi lutali nehinda na nyuwe nyose, mna hamnimanyize? Anione miye, kamuona Tate. Nii naho mwanigamba, ‘Kilagise Tate?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Filipo, mkei hamkuhuwila kugamba miye nimndani mwa Tate, na Tate naye emndani mwangu? Ulosi humigambilani haukulawa kwangu” mna Tate emndani mwangu nie akudamanya izindima. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Huileni viya hulonga kugamba, Tate emndani mwangu miye name ni mndani mwakwe. Uneva hukuhuwila idyo huwila ziya zindima hudamanya. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Namigambilani ikindedi, wadya wakunihuwila nawadamanye yadya hudamanya miye, kindedi, naho nawadamanye mbuli zikujink'ha izi, kwaviya miye naita kwa Tate. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Naho nenidamanye chochose kiya mkuunga kwa zina dyangu, vileke ukulu wa Mnungu uoneke kombokela kwa Mwanawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mnalombeza chochose kwa zina dyangu, neniwadamanyileni.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Muye ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Mnaniunga miye, nomyatoze yadya huwasigiilani. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nenimlombeze Tate naho naawenk'heni mwambizi mtuhu akuunga ekale na nyuwe ulo na ulo. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Yehe ni Muye akulonga ikindedi cha Mnungu. Want'hu wa mwe isi hawakudaha kumhokela kwaviya hawakudaha kumuwona naho hawammanyize. Mna nyuwe mummanya kwaviya ekala na nyuwe naho e mndani mwenyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Nnaita, homsigale mwikedu, neniwauiyeni naho. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Mwo lupisi luguhi lukwiza want'hu wa mwe Isi hawakudaha kuniyona naho vituhu, mna nyuwe namnione, naho kwaviya ni mgima hata nyuwe na mnde wagima. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Zuwa idyo dinabula, nammanye kugamba miye nimndani mwa Tati ywangu naho na nyuwe mndani mwangu, enga viya miye nendile mndani mwenyu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />“Wadya wakutimila miko yangu na kuitimila, awo nawo wakuniunga. Tate yangu naawabwede wadya wakuniunga miye, hata miye neniwabwede nakukelaviliza kwa woho.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, Mna hiyo Yuda Isikaliyote niyo amgambila Yesu, “Zumbe, nainde vivihi kwa weye kukelaviliza kwa suwe naho hiyo kwa want'hu wamwe Isi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Yudya akuniunga naayazumile mahinyo yangu, Tate naambwede, naho miye hamwenga na Tate nakize kwakwe nakwikala kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yudya hakuniunga miye, hakuyazumila mahinizo yangu, naho mahinizo myevile hiyo yangu, mna yeza kulawa kwa Tate yudya aniletile miye mwe ino Isi.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Himigambilani ivi, Kwaviya nikei nili na nyuwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Mwambizi, Muye ywa Mnungu, Yudya Tate akuunga amwigale kombokela dizina dyangu, naawahinizize nyuwe kila kint'hu, naho naawakumbuseni nyuwe mbuli zose niwahinizizeni.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Utondowazi namwasilani nyuwe, utondowazi wangu nawenk'kani. Hikuwenk'hani enga viya isi ikuwenk'ha. Msekogoha naho msekunda na kinyulu. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Na mwiva miye himigambilani, ‘Namwasani mna nenize naho vituhu.’ Uneva namniunga namuunga kugamba miye naita kwa Tate, Kwaviya yehe ni mkulu kujink'ha miye. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Himigambilani mbuli izi zikanda zikei kulaila, vileke yanalaila nyuwe mhuwile. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Hikudaha kugendeela kulonga na nyuwe, Kwaviya yudya akulongoza ino isi eza. Hana udahi kunijika miye, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />mna si zose zaungwa zimanye kugamba namuunga Tate, ivo nivo vilekile nadamanya kila kint'hu kiya akunigamba nidamanye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Soni! Kihalaweni aha hant'hu.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu niye mzabibu we kindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Ni miye mzabibu we kindedi, naho Tate yehe niye mkulima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Tambi hedikweleka adihausa mwangu, naho ayahogowela vedi matambi yadya yakweleka vedi, vileke yande hang'aile yelekese. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nyuwe msunt'higwa kale kwo ulosi udya niwek'heni. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ikaleni mndani mwangu, name nenikale mndani mwenyu. Tambi hadikudaha kweleka dikanda dikedu, mna dyadaha dikeleka dinanda mwo mzabibu, enga iivo, nyuwe hamkudaha kweleka hamnekale mndani mwangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Ni miye mzabibu nyuwe nanywe mwi matambi. Wadya wakwikala mndani mwangu, miye name mndani mwawe, nawelekese kwaviya hamkudaha kudamanya dyodyose hamnandile na miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mnt'hu hanekale mndani mwangu naadulwe kuse enga tambi niyo dya nyala, matambi ayo nayaduganywe hamwenga nakugeligwa mwo moto vileke yahye. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mnekala mndani mwangu niyo ulosi wangu wekala mndani mwenyu, lombezeni chochose mkuunga, nanywe nomwink'higwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Nyuwe mna damanya mbuli zedi Tate naatogolwe, naivo neimanyike kindedi kugamba mwi wanamp'hina wangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Miye nawaunga enga ivo Tate akuniunga miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mnazumila miko yangu nomwikale mwo lukunde lwangu, enga ivo miye nizumile miko ya Tate nakwikala mwo lukunde lwakwe.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Himigambilani ivi vileke kinyemi changu kinde mndani mwenyu kinyemi changu nacho kikint'he. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Sigilizi yangu ni ino. Muungane enga ivo miye niwaungile nyuwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Lukunde lutendese mnt'hu ananalo ni ludya lwo kuulava ugima wakwe kwajili ya wambuyaze. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Nyuwe mnde wambuya zangu mkadamanya yadya huwagambalani. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Miye hikuwetangani naho nyuwe watumwa, kwaviya mtumwa hamanyize yadya akudamanya Zumbe ywakwe, mna nawetanga wambuya kwaviya hiwagambilani kila kint'hu nikivile kulawa kwa Tate. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nyuwe hamnisagule miye, mna miye hiwasagulani nyuwe na kuwasigiilani mwiite mkeleke matunda yakuunga yekale. Naho Tate naawenk'he kint'hu chochose kiya nomuunge kombokela dizina dyangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ino nivo humigambilani, Muungane kila yumwenga na miyawe.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi naiwalemele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Uneva want'hu wanawaihiyani mmanye kugamba nawakonga kuniihiwa miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Uneva nyuwe ni wa ino isi, want'hu we isi hegu nawawaungani kwaviya ni wa isi ino. Mna hiwasagulani nyuwe kulawa mwe ino isi, icho nicho kilekile want'hu wakawaihiyani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Kumbukileni ivo niwagambileni, wandima hiyo wakulu kujink'ha Zumbe ywawe, uneva want'hu nawanisulumiza miye hata nyuwe nawawasulumizeni, uneva nawatimila mahinizo yangu nawatimile ya kwenyu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Mna nawawadamanyizile mbuli zose izi kwaviya nyuwe mwi wangu, Kwaviya hawammanyize yudya anisigiile miye nize. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Uneva hezile na kulonga nawo hegu hawandile na wiihi enga ivi haluse kwaviya hawana dyodyose wakudaha kukegombela. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Mnt'hu akuunga aniihiye miye amwihiya Tate. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Uneva hidamanye mbuli izo niwadamanyileni, naho hahali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kudamanya, nawande hawana masa yo wiihi, mna nawaona ivo miye nidamanye niyo wani ihiya miye hamwenga na Tate. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Mna ino ilaila vileke imbuli iwandikwe mwo Mwiko ukelavilize, ‘Nawaniihiya haheina chotoko chochose.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Mwambizi neeze, Muye akuunga alavilize ikindedi cha Mnungu, yehe akulawa kwa Tate. Muye ywe kindedi naalonge uwona mwa miye. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Naho hata nyuwe namlonge mbuli zangu kwaviya mwandaga na miye kukongela aho nk'hongo.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nahiwagambileni vileke mnasemkaileka imani yenyu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Namguluswe mwe zinyumba za kumvikila Mnungu, naho lupisi naubuze, want'hu nawamanye kugamba yudya akuwakoma nyuwe naende mwe kudamanya Ibada kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Want'hu nawawadamanyizileni vint'hu ivi Kwaviya hawammanyize Tate. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Mna himigambilani ivi vileke umuda unabula wa woho kudamanya ivi, nakumbukile ivo miye niwagambileni.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Indima yakwe mp'heho msuntilwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Aho nk'hongo himigambilani ivi Kwaviya na hinda hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Mna ivi haluse naita kwa yudya aniletile, mna hahali hata yumwenga akunuuza uko hwiita. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Mna Kwaviya himigambilani imioyo yenyu inda na kinyulu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Mna nawagambilani ikindedi, na inde vedi kwa nyuwe uneva nnaita Kwaviya hinaitile mwambizi heeze kwenyu, mna nnaita naho waleteleni umwambizi. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Aho aneza naawa lavanyile want'hu we isi ino kugamba hawe mwe kindedi mwe mbuli yo wavu hamwenga na mbuli zo kwelela na usengelo wa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Mwe imbuli yo wavu waga Kwaviya hawakunihuwila miye. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Mwe mbuli ye ikindedi waga Kwaviya naita kwa Tate naho hamnione, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Naho waga mwe imbuli ye usengelo Kwaviya mkulu we isi ino kasengelwa kale. <verse eid="JHN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Nnanazo mbuli nyingi zakuwagambila mna ivi haluse homdahe kuyafinyiliza. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Muye aneza akuunga alavilize ikindedi cha Mnungu naawaigale mwe kindedi, haalonge zimbuli zakwe yehe mwenye mna naalonge zimbuli ziya akutegeleza, naho naawagambileni mbuli ziya zikwiiza. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Yehe eze anitogole miye Kwaviya naaguhe yadya miye hulonga nakuwagambilani nyuwe. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Yose ananayo Tate ni yangu miye ivo nivo vilekile miye halonga, Muye naaguhe ya kwangu miye nakuwagambilani nyuwe.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyulu hamwenga na kinyemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza hamnione, naho mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza namnione vituhu”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wauzana woho wenye, “Ino ina maana yani? Kakigambila kugamba, mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza hakimuwone naho, vituhu mwe lupisi mdoodo ukwiza nakimuwone, naho kalonga, ‘Kwaviya naita kwa Tate.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Na kanda na maana yani viya akalonga, ‘Lupisi mdodo?’ Hakimanyize idyo akulonga.”<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu na kamanya kugamba waunga wamuuze niyo awagamba, “Hilonga, ‘Mwe lupisi kidodo hamnione, naho mwe lupisi mdodo namnione.’ Mbuli ino niyo mkukiuza nyuwe wenye? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Namigambilani ikindedi, na mwiile na kwiila, mna want'hu wa isi na wande na kinyemi. Na minde na kiholozi mna ikiholozi chenyu na kihituke kunda kinyemi. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Mvele ananda haguhi a kweleka, anda na kinyulu kwaviya lupisi lwakwe lwe masulumizo lubula, mna uneva mwana anelekwa ajala amasulumizo yose, kwaviya ana kinyemi kwa mwana elekwa mwe isi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Ivo niivo mnanavo nyuwe. Ivi haluse mna kinyulu, mna nakaona naho vituhu mioyo yenyu imemile kinyemi. Ikinyemi icho hahali mnt'hu akuunga awahoke.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Mwa dizuwa idyo, homniuze kint'hu chochose. Nawagambilani ikindedi, Tate naawenk'he chochose mlombeza kwa zina dyangu. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Kubula ivi haluse mkei kulombeza kint'hu chochose kwa dizina dyangu, lombezeni naho nomhokele vileke ikinyemi chenyu kikint'he.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzihuma mbuli za mwe isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Hilonga kwa miliganyizo kuwagambilani zimbuli izi, mna lupisi nolubule henilonge naho kwa miliganyizo. Mna nenilonge pwilili mwe mbuli ya Tate. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Mwe dizuwa idyo, nomlombeze kwa zina dyangu. Naho hikuwagambilani kugamba, neniwalombezeleni, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />kwaviya Tate mwenye awaungani. Awaunga kwaviya nyuwe nanywe mwaniungaga, naho mhuwila kugamba hiza kulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Hiza kulawa kwa Tate naho hiza kwe isi, naho ivi haluse nahalawa mwe isi naita kwa Tate.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Niyo wanamp'hina wakwe wamgamba, “Ivi haluse walonga haheina kifiso, naho hiyo kwa miliganyizo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Kimanya ivi haluse kugamba wamanya kila kint'hu. Hukuunga mnt'hu akuuze mbuli. Kwa ivi cha huwila kugamba kulawa kwa Mnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Haluse mwahuwila? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Lupisi lweza naho lubula, hadya nyuwe nyose nomsambale kila yumwenga naaite kwe kaya naho nomnase nikedu. Mna miye hikedu kwaviya Tate e hamwenga na miye. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Himigambileni ivi vileke mnde na utondowazi mwa miye mani kwa kunda mlunganyika hamwenga na miye. Mwe si mna makunt'ho, mna keink'heni moyo miye hiihuma si.”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awalombezela wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu eze abinde ukulonga yano niyo akaula kulanga na kulonga, “Tate udya lupisi ubula, Mtogole mwanao ulehe yehe naye akutogole. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwaviya nakumwink'ha mwanao udahi mwa want'hu wose, vileke awenk'he ugima wa ulo na ulo wadya wose umwink'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ugima wa ulo na ulo ni uno, kukumanya wenye we ekedu Mnungu wa kindedi hamwenga na Yesu Kilisito umsigile. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Miye hikutogola hano he isi, naho hiibindiliza idya ndima unink'hile niidamanye. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Haluse Tate, unink'he ukulu udya nandile nao aho isi ikei kuumbigwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Hikutenda umanyike kwa wadya want'hu unink'hile kulawa kwe isi, nawanda want'hu wako ni weye wanink'ha wande want'hu wangu nawo wauzumila ulosi wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Haluse wamanya kugamba kila kiya unink'hile kilawa kwako. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Miye hiwenk'ha udya ulosi unink'hile, woho nao wauhokela naho wamanya kindedi kugamba ulawa kwako hamwenga na kuzumila kugamba kindedi hilawa kwako naho weye niye unisigile.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nawalombelezela woho, hikuilombelezela isi mna nawalombelezela wadya unink'hile, Kwaviya ni wako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Yose nnanayo ni yako, naho ya kwako ni ya kwangu, naho ukulu yangu wonekana kwa wadya unink'hile. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Naho ivi haluse neza kwako, himuli mwe isi mna woho wamwe isi, Tate msuntilwa kwa udahi dizina dyako unink'hile, naungisa uwaike wande kint'hu kimwenga enga viya sue kili umwenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Viya nendile hamwenga nao nahiwaika vedi kwa udahi we dizina dyako unink'hile. Miye nahiwaamila naho hahali hata yumwenga mwe woho agile, mna ni yudya mwana agile uleke Mawandiko Akukile ukelavilize. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Mna ivi haluse neza kwako, mna hilonga mbuli izi mwe isi vileke washiliki hamwenga na miye ikinyemi nnanacho. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Miye hiwenk'ha ulosi wako naho want'hu wa isi niyo wawaihiwa Kwaviya woho hiyo wa isi enga viya miye name hiyo wa isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Hikulombeza uwahause kulawa mwe isi, mna nalombeza uwahonye na yudya Mwavu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Woho hiyo wa mwe isi enga viya miye. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Waike wande wakukizwe mwe kindedi, ulosi wako ni kindedi. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Enga viya unisigile miye mwe isi, miye name nawasigila woho mwe isi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Naho kwa mbuli ya woho miye mwenye nakeika nikukizwe vileke woho nawo wande wakukizwe mwe kindedi.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Hikuwalombezela woho du mna Nawalombeza hata woho wakunga wahuwile kwa ulosi wao. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nalombeza vileke wose wande kint'hu kimwenga. Tate, Nalombeza wande mndani mwetu enga viya weye undile mndani mwangu name mndani mwako. Nalombeza wande kint'hu kimwenga uleke want'hu wa mwe isi wahuwile kugamba weye niye unisigile. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Miye hiwenk'ha ukulu udya unink'hile miye vileke wande kint'hu kimwenga enga viya suwe kili umwenga. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Miye ninde mndani mwawe nawe mndani mwangu, nalombeza wakint'hizwe kunda kint'hu kimwenga, vileke isi imanye kugamba ni weye wanisigiile. Naho wawaungisa woho enga viya ukuniungisa miye.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tate naunga wadya unink'hile wande hamwenga na miye hadya huunga nili, vileke wauone udya ukulu wangu unink'hile kwaviya weye waniungaga kukongela aho isi ikei kuumbigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Tate ywedi, isi haikukumanya, mna miye hikumanya. Wano nao wakumanya kugamba weye niye unisigile. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Hikutenda umanyike kwawe naho nenigendeele kukutenda ivo, vileke lukunde wandile nao kwangu unde mndani mwawe name ninde mndani mwawe.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agwiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu eze alonge ayo, niyo aita ng'ambu yo mto Keduloni, hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe. Hant'hu aho handaga na bustani, Yesu niyo engila Umwo hamwenga na wanap'hina wakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, Yudya amsezenge Yesu, nakahamanya hant'hu aho kwaviya nk'hanana nyingi Yesu naakadugana na wanamp'hina wakwe uko. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Niyo, Yuda aguha kafyo ka watowani na wamizi kulawa kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo, nokwizanao kwe ibustani. Nawanda na vimuli na magala hamwenga na vitoanilo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, Kwaviya nakamanya yadya yose yakuunga yamlaile niyo awezila na kuwauza, “Mwamzungula ani?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Woho nao niyo wamhitula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ni miye.” Yuda yudya akumsezenga na kanda kakimala haguhi na woho.<verse eid="JHN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Umwo Yesu eze awagambe, “Ni miye.” Niyo wauya kunyuma, na kugwa hasi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu awauza naho, “Mwamzungula ani?” Niyo wamhitula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Hiwagambilani kale kugamba ni miye, haluse uneva mwanizungula miye walekeni wano watuhu wakeitile.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Nakalonga ivo vileke yadya alongaga yakelavilize, “Tate hezile hata yumwenga mwe wadya unink'hile.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petulo andaga na bamba, niyo adisomola no kumsenga digutwi dya kulume mtumwa wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu. Mndima uyo naaketangwa Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu niyo amgamba Petulo, “Vuza idibamba dyako mwe yala. Togola, nise kunywela ikikombe che masulumizo anink'hile Tate?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Ananasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Wadya wank'hondo wawayahudi, niyo wamgwila Yesu na kumkakiliza luzigi, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />naho niyo wanda kumwigala kwa Anasi. Anasi na kanda ise vyala dya Kayafa yehe andile mlava nt'hambiko mkulu mwe mwaka uwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Naho Kayafa nuyo awagambile Wayahudi kugamba, yaungigwa mnt'hu yumwenga abanike hant'hu ha want'hu wengi.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanamp'hina niyo wamtimila Yesu. Yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu na kanda kamanyika kwa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, niyo engila hamwenga na Yesu kundani hant'hu hakuduganikila ha mlava nt'hambiko mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Mna Petulo andaga kakimala kuse hagihi no umnango, Mna yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu andile akamanyika na Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu niyo afosa kuse na kulonga na mvele yumwenga andile ho mnango amlekela Petulo engile kundani. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Yudya mvele ho mnango niyo amgamba Petulo, “Weye wi yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wa uyu mnt'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Petulo niyo amhitula, “Miye hiyo mwa woho.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Wandima hamwenga na wamizi nawakweleza moto niyo wanda wotela Kwaviya na kunda na mp'heho. Petulo naye na kanda hamwenga na woho akotela moto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu amuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22:66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Niyo mlava nt'hambiko mkulu amuuza Yesu, mwe mbuli ya wanamp'hina wakwe hamwenga na mahinizo yakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nehilonga na kila mnt'hu haheina kukefisa, Lupisi wose nahihiniza mwe zinyumba nk'hulu za Mnungu hamwenga na mwe nyumba za Mnungu mdya wakuduganikila wayahudi wose naho hina idyo nilongile kwa kukefisa. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Ni mbwai kuniuza miye? Wauze wadya wanivile. Wauzeni yadya niwagambile, wayamanya yadya niwagambile.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Eze alonge ayo mwamizi yumwenga andile kakimala aho niyo amtowa Yesu, no kumgamba, “Togola, nivo ukumhitula mlava nt'hambiko mkulu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu amhitula, “Uneva hilonga vihiye, lagisa uwo wiihi. Mna uneva hilonga vedi, wanitoelai?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Niyo Anasi amwigala Yesu ivo akakilizwe, kwo mlava nt'hambiko mkulu uyo Kayafa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela naho Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni naye Petulo andaga akei aaho akotela moto. Basi, niyo wamuza, “Togola, weye nawe wiyumwo mwa wanamp'hina wakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Petulo niyo ahitula. “Bule, hiyo miye.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumwenga mwa wandima wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu yudya akantigwe idigutwi ni Petulo, amuzaga, “Togola, miye hikuwone weye kwe bustani hamwenga na uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petulo alemelaga naaho, aaho zogolo niyo dyaila,<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Basi, niyo wamguha Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa, no kumwigala kwe nyumba ye kiseuta. Yandaga kilokilo, vileke wadahe kudya pasaka, hawengile mwe nyumba yo uzumbe wanase kugeligwa usavu. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kwa ivo, Pilato awabasaga uko kuse no agamba, “Mna mlahowani no mnt'hu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Niyo wamhitula, “Uneva uyu hiyo Mwavu hegu hakimletile kwako.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato niyo awagaba, “Hayani, mguheni nyuwe wenye, mkamsengele vikuligana ne miko yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Suwe hakina udahi wa kumkoma mnt'hu yoyose.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Nevinda ivo vileke ukelavilize ulosi udya Yesu alongaga kugamba, naafe file yani.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilato niyo engila vituhu kwenyumba ikwitangwa ikulu, amwitanga Yesu na kumuza, “Hambwe weye niwe Zumbe ywa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Togola, izi ni mbuli zako hegu want'hu wakugambilaga zimbuli zangu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato niyo amhitula, “Togola, Miye ni Myahudi? Kabila dyako naho wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wakuleta kwangu. Kubanangai?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Useuta wangu hiyo we isi ino, Uneva Useuta wangu wandile we isi ino, wandima wangu na wanigombela nisekugeligwa mwe mikono ya Wayahudi. Mna haluse Useuta wangu hiyo wa aha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Aho Pilato niyo amgamba, “Haluse weye wi Zumbe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu amhitula, “Weye kulonga kugamba miye ni Zumbe. Miye hyelekwa kwa mbuli ino imwenga, kulonga ikindedi, mkindedi yeyose naanitegeleze.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato niyo amgamba, “Ikindedi ni kint'hu chani?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu asengelwa file</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato eze alonge ivo, niyo awabasa naho Wayahudi niyo awagamba, “Miye hione mbuli yoyose iihile kwakwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Mna yaungigwa miye niwakomoele mvugailwa yumwenga mwe pasaka. Haluse mwaunga niwakomoele Zumbe ywa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Aho niyo wata kubongeela, “Bule! Hiyo uyo, kikomoele Balaba!” Uyo Balaba andaga mhoki wa vint'hu want'hu.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Niyo Pilato amguha Yesu no kugenda kumtoa mikotya. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Wank'hondo niyo wadamanya nk'hofia ya miwa niyo wamvala mwo mtwi, naho niyo waguha suke ye zambalau nakumvala. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Niyo wamwizila nakumgamba, “Wikale mp'heho Zumbe ywa Wayahudi.” Naho niyo wagendeela kumtowa.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato niyo afosa kuse kaidi nokudigamba idifyo dya want'hu. “Kauleni, mguheni mnt'hu uyu vileke mmanye kugamba miye hikuona wiihi wowose mwo mnt'hu uyu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Niyo Yesu afosa kuse availe nk'hofia ye miwa mwo mtwi naho kavaligwa suke ya zambalau. Pilato niyo awagamba, “Suyoni Mnt'hu ywenyu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Niyo wadya wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wandima wawe weze wamuwone wakonga kugutila wakagamba, “Muwambe! Pilato Muwambe!”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Kina miko ikugamba aungwa kukomwa, kwaviya aketanga Mwana wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato eze eve ivo niyo engilwa na wogofi mkulu. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Niyo auya kwe nyumba yo ulava nt'hambiko no kumuuza Yesu, “Weye kulawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Mna Yesu hamhitule. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilato niyo amgamba Yesu, “Hukuunga kulonga na miye? Umanye, nna udahi wa kukulekela weye unde mwenye nyumba naho nna udahi wakukuwamba mwo mti wa masulmizo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Una udahi mwa miye Kwaviya nokwink'higwa ni Mnungu, yudya aniletile kwako anawiihi mkulu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilato eze eve ivo, niyo azungula sila ya kumlekela Yesu. Mna idifyo dya Wayahudi niyo dyagutila, “Uneva unamlekela hounde mbuya na Seuta ywa Kilumi, mnt'hu yeyeso anaketenda Zumbe naende haaivane na seuta ywa Kilumi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato eze eve ivo want'hu nawakalonga, niyo amguha Yesu no kuita naye kuse no kwikala mwe ukalo wakwe wo usengelo hant'hu hakwitangwa sakafu ya maiwe kwa ulosi wa Kiibulania nahaketangwa, “Gabasa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Naho neinda nomsi want'hu wakakeika lumwe kwa pasaka. Pilato niyo awagamba Wayahudi, “Zumbe wenyu uyu eaha.”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Niyo wagutila, Mkome, mkome, muwambe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato niyo awauza, “Nyuwe mwaunga miye nimkome Zumbe wenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko niyo wamhitula, “Suwe hakina Zumbe yeyose mna Seuta ywa Kilumi uuyo du.”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pilato niyo amwink'hiza mwe mikono yawe vileke awambigwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu awambigwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Niyo wamguha Yesu vileke wamuwambe. <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu niyo afosa kuse no kwinula msalaba wakwe wa masulumizo mpaka hant'hu hakwitangwa “Kibela cha mtwi” kwa Kiibulania Goligota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Wamuwambaga hadya, hamwenga na want'hu watuhu waidi, Yumwenga kumoso na wakaidi mkono wakwe wa kulume, Yesu nae andaga hagati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato nakawandika mwe kabao niyo kaikigwa halanga he msalaba, “YESU MNAZALETI ZUMBE WA WAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Wayahudi wengi nawasoma Kwaviya hant'hu hadya Yesu awambilwe na handa hiyo hale na ho mzi. Naho nayaandikwa kwa Kiibulania, kilumi hamwenga na Kigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu niyo amgamba Pilato, “Usekuwandika, ‘Zumbe wa wayahudi mna uyu mnt'hu naakagamba, miye ni miye Zumbe wa wayahudi.’ ”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato niyo awahitula, “Yadya niwandike haya kuhitulwa.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Wank'hondo weze wajike kumuwamba Yesu, niyo waguha isuke yakwe nakuipanga mafungu mane, kila yumwenga na fungu dyakwe. Naho niyo waguha nk'hazu yakwe naho nk'hanzu idya ne inda haisumigwe mna ita kufumigwa kukongela kulanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Wadya wank'hondo niyo wagambana, “Kisekuitatula mna kitowe kula kikaule ni ani akuunga aink'higwe.” Uleke ukelavilize Mawandiko Akukile udya Mawandiko Akukilegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Naawakepangila zisuke zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">no kuitoela kula nk'hanzu yangu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Iivi nivo wadamanye wadya wank'hondo.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Wandaga hagihi no msalaba hadya awambilwe Yesu wandaga, ni nine dya Yesu, lumbudye dya nine dya Yesu, Maliamu mkaziwe dya Kiliopa, hamwenga na Malia Magedalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu niyo amuwona nine hamwenga na yudya mwanamp'hina amuungisaga wakimala, niyo amgamba nine, “Uyo nuyo umwanao.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Naho niyo amgamba yudya mwanamp'hina ywakwe, “Uyo nuyo nyokwe.” Kukongela aho yudya mwanamp'hina niyo amgumha yudya nine no kugenda kwikala nae kwe nyumba yakwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Kukongela hadya, Yesu nakamanya kugamba kila kint'hu nechajika, naho vileke kila Mawandiko Akukile ukint'he, niyo agamba, “Naona nk'hilu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Nahanda na kiyamp'ha kimemile siki, niyo watufika ditambala idyo mwe kiyamp'ha kine siki, niyo wadi zinganiza mwa kaziti katali, niyo wamwink'hiliza mwo mnomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu eze ajink'he kuinywa idya siki niyo afunamiza mtwi hasi akagamba, “Isila.”<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajungwa gola mwo lubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Niyo wadya wakulu wa wayahudi waita na kumlombeza Pilato vileke awenk'he kuwavuna iviga wadya want'hu wawambigwe, hamwenga no kuiseleza imili yawe. Nawamuuza ivi Kwaviya neinda ijumaa, naho hawaungile imili iyo ikale mwe misalaba viwambilo mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Niyo wank'hondo waita na kuvuna iviga va yudya mnt'hu wa nk'hongo hamwenga na mtuhu, wadya want'hu wawambigwe hamwenga na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Mna weze wabule kwa Yesu niyo wambwila kabanika kale vilekile hawamvunile iviga vakwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Mnk'hondo yumwenga niyo mtunga Yesu na mjungo wakwe mwo lubavu lwakwe, aaho niyo mwalawa sakame na mazi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Yudya aone na kalonga naho yadya alongile ni ya kindedi naho kamanya kugamba alonga kindedi naho alonga ivo vileke nyuwe nanywe mhuwile. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ino na inda ivi vileke yadya yawandikwe yande kindedi, “Hadihali hata vuha dyakwe dimwenga divunigwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Naho yeyuko Mawandiko matuhu ya Mnungu yakugamba, “Want'hu nawamkaule yudya wamjungile mjungo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aikigwa mwe kikuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Yeze yajike, na handa na mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Yusufu, endile akekala kwo mzi wa Alimatayo, niyo aita kwa Pilato na kumlombeza umwili wa Yesu, Mnt'hu uyu andaga mwanamp'hina Yesu kwa kinyele Kwaviya naakawogoha vilongozi we Kiyahudi. Pilato niyo amzumila uleke auguhe mwili wa Yesu, Yosefu aitaga niyo auguha umwili wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemo yudya aitaga kwa Yesu nekilo, niyo aita hamwenga na Yusufu naho nakaguha manemane hamwenga na udi ukubula madebe maidi. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Wagosi awa waidi niyo wauguha umwili wa Yesu na kuuvunganiza sanda, enga viya wayahudi wandaga wakadatenda, mwo kuuikia lumwe umwili vileke umoswe msanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Na handa na nk'honde haguhi na hadya Yesu awambigwe, naho na handa na kikuta chandile kikei kumosa msanga mnt'hu yeyose <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwaviya neinda mwe kuikila lumwe kwa Wayahudi mwa zuwa ya kuhumula, niyo wauwika umwili wa Yesu kwe mp'hanga yandile hagihi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kikuta hekiina mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Mtootondo zuwa dya nk'hongo dya juma, umwo kwandile kukei mazilizili, Maliamu Magedalena aitaga kwe kikuta, niyo abwiila diiwe dihauswa kulawa mwe mwe nk'hili ye kikuta. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Niyo aguluka kuita kwa Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanamp'hina mtuhu yudya Yesu naakamuungisa, niyo awagambila, “Wauguha umwili wa Zumbe mwe kikuta, naho hakimanyize aho waikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Niyo Petulo hamwenga na wanamp'hina watuhu waita mwe kikuta. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Waidi wawe niyo waguluka, mna yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu niyo agulukisa kumjink'ha Petulo, awo wanda wa nk'hongo mpaka he kikuta. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Niyo afunama akaula kundani, no kuiona isanda ihank'handa, mna heingile kundani. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Kunyuma kwakwe niyo eza Simoni Petulo, yehe niyo engila kundani kwe kikuta. abwiilaga vitambala ve sanda vihank'handa. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Hamwenga na suke afungilwe Yesu mwo mtwi wakwe. Havandile hamwenga ne sanda, ila neivunyangizwa hank'handa yoho yenye. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Niyo mwanamp'hina mtuhu yudya andaga ywa nk'hongo mpaka he kikuta, naye engilaga kundani kwe kikuta niyo aona niyo ahuwila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Niyo wanda hawakombaganye Mawandiko yakukile yadya nayakagamba naauyuke. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Niyo wadya wanamp'hina wauya kaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlaila Maliamu Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliamu niyo akimaala akaila haise he kikuta. Viya andile akei akaila, niyo afunama akakaula kundani mwe kikuta. <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />Niyo awaona watumigwa waidi wavaile suke zing'aile wekale hant'hu handile no umwili wakwe Yesu, yumwenga kwo mtwi ywa kaidi naye kwe viga. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Niyo wamuuza, “Mvele wailai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Niyo amhitula, “Wamguha Zumbe ywangu, naho himanyize uko wamwiikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Niyo ahituka kunyuma amuwona Yesu kakimala, mna habunk'hule kugamba andaga ni Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu niyo amuuza, “Mvele wailai? Wamzungula ani?” Maliamu akafanyanya kugamba uyo andaga ni yudya akukikaula ikiunga, akamgamba, “Mkulu, nigambile uko umwikile name nehamguhe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Maliamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Niyo amhitukila niyo alonga naye mwe Kiibulania, “Laboni!” Nuko kugamba, “Mhinizi.” <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Usekunitoza, kwaviya nikei kuuya kulanga kwa Tate. Mna ita ukawagambile ndugu zangu kugamba, nauya kwa Tate naho hata woho ni Tati yawe. Mnungu ywangu naho Mnungu ywawe.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Niyo Maliamu Magedalena aita nakuwagambila wanamp'hina kugamba kamuona Zumbe. Naho kamsigiila eze awagambile.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Yandaga kisingi zuwa dya nk'hongo dya juma, wanamp'hina nawanda we mwe nyumba wakevugaila zinyivi kwaviya nawakawogoha wakulu wa Wayahudi. Yesu awalailaga na kukimaala hagati hawe na kuwagamba, “Utondowazi unde na nyuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Eze ajike kulonga ivi, niyo awalagisa mikono yakwe hamwenga no lubavu lwakwe. Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wanda na kinyemi kikulu Kwaviya wamuwone Zumbe. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu niyo awagamba naho, “Utondowazi unde na nyuwe, enga viya tate anisigiile miye, miye name nawasigiilani nyuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Eze ajike kulonga ayo niyo awavikila no kuwagamba, “Hokeleni Muye ywa Mnungu.” <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mnawausila want'hu wavu wawe nawausilwe, hamna wausile hawakudaha kuusilwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Yumwenga mwe wadya mlongo na waidi, akwitangwa Tomasi hegu pasa, andaga hahali hamwenga na wadya wanamp'hina weyawe umwo Yesu akawalaila. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Wanamp'hina watuhu niyo wamgamba, “Kimuona Zumbe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomaso niyo awagamba, “Uneva hione zink'hovu ze mitunga mwe mikono yakwe hamwenga na kugela kadole mwe zink'hovu na kugela mkono mwo lubavu lwakwe, hikudaha kuhuwila.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Juma dimwenga dizedyomboke wanamp'hina na wanda hamwenga kwe nyumba, Tomasi na kanda hamwenga na woho. Ulwivi wandaga uvugalwa mna Yesu niyo eza no kwingila niyo akimaala hagati na kuwagamba, “Utondowazi unde na nyuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Yesu niyo amgamba Tomasi, “Gela kadole kako aha, naho kaula mikono yangu. Naho lete umkono wako uugele mwo lubavu lwangu. Usekukunda hwiina mhuwi, uhuwile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi niyo amhitula, “Zumbe ywangu na Mnungu ywangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Niyo Yesu amgamba, “Kuhuwila kwaviya kaniona? Wavikilwa wadya wakuhuwila haheina kuniyona.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Mwa meso ya wanamp'hina wakwe Yesu nakadamanya vilagiso vingi heviwandikwe mwe kitabu iki. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Mna aya yawandikwa vileke want'hu wahuwile kugamba Yesu niye Kilisito Mwana Mnungu, na kwa kuhuwila mdahe kunda na ugima kwa ludole lwe dizina dyakwe.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanamp'hina mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Yesu eze awalaile naho wanamp'hina wakwe kwe bahali ya Tibelia, vandaga ivi, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petulo na Tomasi akwitangwa pasa hamwenga na Natanaeli mkaya wa Kana ya Galilaya na wana waidi wa Zebedayo hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe watuhu waidi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petulo niyo awagamba, “Nagenda kulowa zisamaki.” Niyo wamhitula, “Nekiitanye hamwenga na weye.” Niyo waita kuse na kwingila mwe ngalawa, mna mwe kiya kilo chose hawapatile samaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Mtondo zuwa dika tontomoka, Yesu niyo akimaala hank'handa he bahali, mna wanamp'hina wakwe na wanda hawabunk'hule kugamba ni yehe. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Niyo Yesu awetanga no kuwauza, “Wambuyazangu, togoleni! Hamgwiile chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Niyo wamhitula, “Hakipatile kint'hu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Niyo awagamba, “Duleni lwavu lwenyu mkono wo kulume we ingalawa, nomlowe.” Ivo niyo waduula no kudunduga kwinula lwavu kundani kwe ngalawa kwaviya nawalowa samaki zibindile ingi.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Niyo yudya mwanamp'hina aungiswe ni Yesu amgamba Petulo, “Uyu ni Zumbe Yesu.” Simoni Petulo eze eve kugamba yudya andaga ni Zumbe Yesu, niyo akevala suke yakwe idya aihambule umwo andile mwa mazi, niyo apilika mwa mazi. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Wanamp'hina wamwenga niyo wamtimila ne ngalawa wakavuta lwavu lumemile samaki, kwaviya na wanda hawehale no kunk'handa kwe bahali, na wanda enga nk'hacho gana dimwenga, mpaka kunk'handa kwe bahali. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Weze waseele hasi, niyo wabwiila moto hamwenga na samaki ikokigwa, hamwenga na mkate.<verse eid="JHN 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nink'heni samaki izo mlowile.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Niyo Simoni Petulo aita mwe ngalawa akonga kuvuta ulwavu kulawa kwa mazi lumemile samaki nk'hulu zikubula gana dimwenga na milongo mishano na nt'hatu. Samaki nezinda nyingi mna lwavu halutatuke. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Soni mdye!” Hahali hata mwanamp'hina yeyose amuuzile Yesu kugamba, “Weye niwe ani?” Kwaviya nawammanya andaga ni Zumbe. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu niyo aguha mkate nokuwenk'ha, niyo atenda iivo kwe samaki.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Naho ino neinda malavo ya Yesu ya katatu akawalaila wanamp'hina wakwe umwo eze ande kauyuka.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hamwenga na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Weze wajike ukudya, Yesu niyo amgamba Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana Yohana, weye waniunga kujink'ha woseni awa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Simoni niyo amhitula, “Heiye Zumbe, kumanya kugamba nakuungisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima Zingoto zangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Kaidi naho, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Simoni mwana Yohana, waniungisa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Niyo ahitula, “Heiye Zumbe, kumanya kugamba nakuungisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima zingoto zangu.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Katatu naho, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Simoni mwana Yohana, waniunga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Petulo niyo engilwa ni kinyulu kwaviya Yesu nakamuuza nk'hanana ya katatu “Weye waniunga?” Niyo amgamba, “Zumbe kumanya kila kint'hu, kumanya kugamba miye nakuunga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima zingoto zangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ikindedi nakugambila, umwo wandile mdodo noukahina na kuita kokose kudya noukaunga, mna unadalahala nowinule mikono yako niyo mnt'hu mtuhu akuguha nakukwigala kunt'hu hwikukuunga.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu alongaga ivi akalagisa ivo Petulo akuunga abanike nakumwink'ha Mnungu ukulu. Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanamp'hina watuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petulo niyo ahituka kunyuma, niyo amuwona yudya mwanamp'hina naakaungiswa ni Yesu atimila. Niye yudya ekeegamile mwe kifua cha Yesu umwo wandile holudyo no kumuuza, “Zumbe akuunga akusezenge niani?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petulo eze amuone, niyo amuuza Zumbe Yesu, “Zumbe, uyu mnt'hu naye?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Uneva naunga ekale mpaka aho heza kuuya, weye waiungilai!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Niyo mbuli idya yagendezwa mwa wandugu awo kugamba mwanamp'hina yudya haabanike. Mna Yesu halongile kugamba habanike mna nakagamba, “Uneva nnaunga ekale mpaka aho heza kuuya, weye wayaungilai?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Mwanamp'hina uyu niye alongile zimbuli izi, naho ni yehe ayawandike, naho nakamanya yadya naakayalonga ayawandike ya kindedi.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkomelezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Naho kuna mbuli zibindile ingi Yesu azidamanye, uneva zose zawandikagwa imwe imwe, nikindedi kugamba si yose hayakint'hile, ivitabu ivo.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>